1
00:00:03,750 --> 00:02:03,750
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries

2
00:02:04,185 --> 00:02:08,264
No living being was harmed during the
filming of this series.

3
00:02:08,725 --> 00:02:11,565
Episode 106

4
00:02:12,315 --> 00:02:14,325
- After a day -
This palace...

5
00:02:16,885 --> 00:02:18,765
is the heart of the state.

6
00:02:20,235 --> 00:02:22,325
However, Sultan İsmihan...

7
00:02:22,745 --> 00:02:27,755
thinks she will do what she wants in
our lands as she does in her palace.

8
00:02:30,095 --> 00:02:32,665
We will not allow it.

9
00:02:34,625 --> 00:02:39,185
Now, she will unite with our
enemies to strike us.

10
00:02:39,775 --> 00:02:42,105
You didn't liberate Kantakuzanos in vain.

11
00:02:42,665 --> 00:02:44,505
She must cooperate with him.

12
00:02:45,825 --> 00:02:48,445
Her eyes were blinded by her greed.

13
00:02:48,735 --> 00:02:53,535
This woman might put Olof
under her command.

14
00:02:53,795 --> 00:02:55,575
We won't let her do that.

15
00:02:55,885 --> 00:02:59,495
Her position gives her great power and for
that reason, we have to kill her in order to stop her.

16
00:02:59,515 --> 00:03:00,785
No.

17
00:03:01,375 --> 00:03:05,115
Her position and greed make her arrogant.

18
00:03:05,985 --> 00:03:07,855
This is her weak point.

19
00:03:09,135 --> 00:03:11,155
We will attack her from this weak point.

20
00:03:11,335 --> 00:03:14,045
Then, I had better have them prepare the
presents...

21
00:03:14,435 --> 00:03:15,935
to deceive her.

22
00:03:17,805 --> 00:03:19,535
She won't be fooled by this.

23
00:03:21,055 --> 00:03:22,875
We need something bigger than this.

24
00:03:23,425 --> 00:03:25,495
Will we kiss her hand and obey, father?

25
00:03:26,945 --> 00:03:28,995
She will not be convinced otherwise.

26
00:03:30,165 --> 00:03:31,715
We will do what is necessary.

27
00:03:32,095 --> 00:03:34,595
What are we going to do
after stopping her, father?

28
00:03:35,065 --> 00:03:36,825
What we always do.

29
00:03:38,495 --> 00:03:41,065
One enemy goes and another comes.

30
00:03:41,345 --> 00:03:43,705
But the homeland of the
Turks remains forever.

31
00:03:45,285 --> 00:03:47,095
We will continue the conquests.

32
00:03:48,615 --> 00:03:52,615
Saruca is after Sultan İsmihan.

33
00:03:52,995 --> 00:03:56,295
He will tell us who she meets and sees.

34
00:03:57,035 --> 00:03:59,745
You're talking about
enemy campaigns but...

35
00:04:00,295 --> 00:04:01,995
What about a friend?

36
00:04:02,055 --> 00:04:05,185
We can't defeat the enemy if
the brothers don't unite, Bala

37
00:04:06,515 --> 00:04:09,935
And no one can close
these cracks except a brother.

38
00:04:12,355 --> 00:04:14,485
Turgut Bey will certainly be with us.

39
00:04:16,295 --> 00:04:17,805
What if he doesn't, my Bey?

40
00:04:21,964 --> 00:04:24,065
İnegöl Castle

41
00:04:24,755 --> 00:04:27,315
We sensed your absence from
headquarters, Turgut Bey.

42
00:04:27,385 --> 00:04:30,225
But you know that going out on
the path of conquest is by faith.

43
00:04:30,225 --> 00:04:31,725
No need to convince
anyone of that.

44
00:04:31,745 --> 00:04:33,455
Do you teach that to us, Konur?

45
00:04:33,525 --> 00:04:34,725
No.

46
00:04:34,815 --> 00:04:35,535
Your absence...

47
00:04:35,565 --> 00:04:37,565
Do not blame me for my absence.

48
00:04:39,405 --> 00:04:43,145
I fought tirelessly all these years.

49
00:04:43,215 --> 00:04:46,225
I did not come to talk about the past.

50
00:04:48,265 --> 00:04:50,715
You have a problem with
my Bey, solve it with him.

51
00:04:51,325 --> 00:04:54,445
I have come to take our
catapults at his command.

52
00:04:57,155 --> 00:04:58,465
Okay.

53
00:04:59,785 --> 00:05:01,155
Okay.

54
00:05:09,705 --> 00:05:11,535
Where are you now, Konur?

55
00:05:17,005 --> 00:05:18,325
İnegöl.

56
00:05:19,055 --> 00:05:22,775
The catapults you're talking about
are the ones that took Inegol.

57
00:05:23,335 --> 00:05:26,165
These catapults are the keys
to the castle, as they say.

58
00:05:27,875 --> 00:05:29,895
They are mine just like İnegöl.

59
00:05:30,045 --> 00:05:31,875
It is up to me to handle it.

60
00:05:35,495 --> 00:05:37,055
No.

61
00:05:38,225 --> 00:05:40,245
Will you make yourself priority?

62
00:05:41,475 --> 00:05:43,985
Nothing could be more important
than my calling.

63
00:05:44,045 --> 00:05:46,405
Everything I do is to please Allah.

64
00:05:46,425 --> 00:05:48,675
My concern is justice, Konur, don't
you see that?

65
00:05:48,685 --> 00:05:50,835
Do you relieve yourself like that?

66
00:05:50,845 --> 00:05:52,575
Did greed blind your
eyes to this degree?

67
00:05:52,595 --> 00:05:54,465
No, you got it wrong, Konur.

68
00:05:54,475 --> 00:05:56,305
Seeking the truth is not greedy.

69
00:05:56,325 --> 00:05:57,905
I haven't spoken all these years.

70
00:05:57,945 --> 00:05:59,805
How Osman Bey treated me is clear.

71
00:05:59,825 --> 00:06:01,075
You're
wrong, Turgut Bey.

72
00:06:01,105 --> 00:06:02,935
I haven't chosen my path yet, Konur.

73
00:06:08,705 --> 00:06:10,435
Go to headquarters.

74
00:06:11,905 --> 00:06:14,115
I will inform Osman Bey. of my decision

75
00:06:17,305 --> 00:06:19,485
Take Konur to the castle exit.

76
00:06:31,425 --> 00:06:33,745
The wound in my chest has not yet healed.

77
00:06:34,935 --> 00:06:37,585
Don't open another wound, Turgut Bey.

78
00:06:38,675 --> 00:06:40,535
We are waiting for good news from you.

79
00:06:51,935 --> 00:06:55,165
We have the same goal with people like
İsmihan Sultan.

80
00:06:55,515 --> 00:06:58,855
But what makes us different from them...

81
00:06:59,775 --> 00:07:01,305
is our concern.

82
00:07:02,155 --> 00:07:04,225
Their goal is gold and royalty.

83
00:07:04,725 --> 00:07:07,105
As for us, our goal is the homeland.

84
00:07:07,555 --> 00:07:09,505
They want the sword for power.

85
00:07:09,505 --> 00:07:11,285
What about us?

86
00:07:11,835 --> 00:07:13,845
We want it to spread justice.

87
00:07:14,755 --> 00:07:21,255
They want the position, the chair,
and the throne for their vanity.

88
00:07:21,435 --> 00:07:27,145
But we want it in order to rule justly.

89
00:07:28,455 --> 00:07:30,285
This is the difference between us.

90
00:07:33,175 --> 00:07:35,265
And what makes us strong...

91
00:07:36,205 --> 00:07:37,505
is this.

92
00:07:37,565 --> 00:07:39,655
So let's crush the enemy with this power.

93
00:07:41,365 --> 00:07:43,765
The enemy fronts will separate now.

94
00:07:44,425 --> 00:07:47,265
The enemies
are sharpening their teeth against us.

95
00:07:48,185 --> 00:07:51,485
But we are not united now.

96
00:07:52,935 --> 00:07:55,365
For this reason, we will
not crush anyone.

97
00:07:57,315 --> 00:07:58,845
We'll be smart.

98
00:08:01,175 --> 00:08:02,765
Malhun Hatun.

99
00:08:02,795 --> 00:08:05,885
Go to the Mother Sultan with your retinue.

100
00:08:06,135 --> 00:08:08,495
And give her our best gifts.

101
00:08:09,135 --> 00:08:10,955
Show her our sincerity.

102
00:08:11,695 --> 00:08:13,505
If that will stop it...

103
00:08:13,605 --> 00:08:16,605
she will find no better gift
than our faithfulness, my Bey.

104
00:08:17,565 --> 00:08:19,135
You are right.

105
00:08:19,815 --> 00:08:24,885
Bala, you will come with me
to Köprühisar headquarters.

106
00:08:24,925 --> 00:08:27,835
Me and the female warriors
are behind you, my Bey.

107
00:08:29,565 --> 00:08:33,245
Olof and Kantakuzenos...

108
00:08:33,765 --> 00:08:35,565
And İsmihan Sultan.

109
00:08:36,735 --> 00:08:38,794
They'll all think we stopped.

110
00:08:39,125 --> 00:08:41,275
But we will never stop.

111
00:08:42,664 --> 00:08:45,515
İsmihan Sultan and Kantakuzenos.

112
00:08:46,125 --> 00:08:47,855
They will move together.

113
00:08:48,835 --> 00:08:51,345
If we move before the enemy...

114
00:08:52,115 --> 00:08:53,995
we will be victorious.

115
00:09:09,035 --> 00:09:13,865
It's time to make a deal to confront
Osman, who's manipulating our borders.

116
00:09:18,765 --> 00:09:21,505
What worries you?

117
00:09:24,525 --> 00:09:30,225
Why ally with me instead
of allying with one of you?

118
00:09:30,905 --> 00:09:36,085
He who does not
oppose us is of us, Kantakuzenos.

119
00:09:37,025 --> 00:09:40,725
Osman grew up under the wings
of the Seljuk Empire.

120
00:09:41,795 --> 00:09:45,115
But he acted according to his whims.

121
00:09:45,985 --> 00:09:48,595
He did not stop at acting
according to his whims.

122
00:09:49,065 --> 00:09:52,115
He even clawed his bloody
hand to Constantinople.

123
00:09:53,095 --> 00:09:54,895
I know everything.

124
00:09:55,555 --> 00:09:57,375
The weaker the state is...

125
00:09:57,695 --> 00:09:59,775
The traitors' voice becomes loud.

126
00:10:01,545 --> 00:10:03,435
So let's cut that sound out.

127
00:10:06,495 --> 00:10:08,625
Don't you want to hear our terms?

128
00:10:11,785 --> 00:10:16,575
You will not attack the Turks
or any Turkish village.

129
00:10:19,435 --> 00:10:21,805
My war is with Osman only.

130
00:10:22,195 --> 00:10:26,335
No Turk will be harmed who
does not draw the sword against me.

131
00:10:27,035 --> 00:10:28,885
As long as our goal is the same...

132
00:10:29,705 --> 00:10:33,985
Then you know I'll have your back, Kantakuzenos...

133
00:10:35,175 --> 00:10:37,955
to have the throne of Byzantium
that you want the most.

134
00:10:39,925 --> 00:10:43,395
I am grateful, Your Majesty,
but I am no longer the heir...

135
00:10:43,955 --> 00:10:45,695
rather, I own the throne.

136
00:10:47,985 --> 00:10:50,815
The Emperor is so ill that he
can't use his powers.

137
00:10:51,955 --> 00:10:55,055
For this reason, I will run
the empire on his behalf.

138
00:10:58,405 --> 00:11:01,845
Our strength towards Osman increases.

139
00:11:02,255 --> 00:11:05,105
If we can find out what
Osman is after...

140
00:11:05,675 --> 00:11:08,435
The power we possess will double.

141
00:11:09,425 --> 00:11:11,475
He is looking for a new conquest.

142
00:11:11,945 --> 00:11:13,815
It could be Koyunhisar...

143
00:11:14,435 --> 00:11:16,255
It could be Çadırlı.

144
00:11:16,995 --> 00:11:18,795
Or Köprühisar.

145
00:11:19,475 --> 00:11:22,065
He must want to take one of them.

146
00:11:26,295 --> 00:11:28,315
Who knows what you are up to.

147
00:11:30,755 --> 00:11:33,315
I knew it wouldn't stop
after taking Marmaracık.

148
00:11:34,125 --> 00:11:37,375
We must know his campaign
in advance and stop him.

149
00:11:47,795 --> 00:11:49,365
Come here.

150
00:12:19,755 --> 00:12:22,805
Don't worry, Kantakuzenos.

151
00:12:23,505 --> 00:12:25,875
Osman has been watching me for a while.

152
00:12:26,025 --> 00:12:28,035
What does this mean?
Do you suspect us?

153
00:12:28,855 --> 00:12:31,415
He must not be made aware
of our agreement in any way

154
00:12:31,455 --> 00:12:34,485
Osman is trying to stop me.

155
00:12:49,985 --> 00:12:54,565
You agree with
him to stop my Bey.

156
00:12:55,145 --> 00:13:00,155
But you can not stop
those who take the path of truth.

157
00:13:21,045 --> 00:13:26,195
Unfortunately, the dead can not
speak, Kantakuzenos.

158
00:13:28,225 --> 00:13:35,375
Are you ready to stand by me as I destroy
Osman's lands?

159
00:13:57,295 --> 00:14:00,135
What are we waiting for
to attack them, Olof?

160
00:14:03,935 --> 00:14:06,085
We are waiting for the
right time, brother.

161
00:14:12,805 --> 00:14:19,835
Our patience will be the
key to our victory this time.

162
00:14:27,775 --> 00:14:30,055
There are people coming.

163
00:14:30,895 --> 00:14:33,545
There are people coming.

164
00:14:38,635 --> 00:14:44,525
In addition to our agreement with
those who live with our enemy...

165
00:15:03,195 --> 00:15:09,285
- Tell me where to attack.
- You're hasty like Osman, Olof.

166
00:15:09,755 --> 00:15:13,515
Where is Osman after now?

167
00:15:13,585 --> 00:15:18,165
We know that Osman seeks
after the conquests, but...

168
00:15:18,775 --> 00:15:21,335
We don't know where he will attack.

169
00:15:21,625 --> 00:15:24,475
But we will know for sure.

170
00:15:25,175 --> 00:15:30,205
And when we know, we will hit him
before he reaches his goal.

171
00:15:30,635 --> 00:15:36,675
Why did you come now when you don't know
where Osman will attack?

172
00:15:37,865 --> 00:15:40,385
I came to tell you what we're going to do.

173
00:15:41,465 --> 00:15:47,075
We will wreak havoc inside and you'll
attack that place where we wreak havoc.

174
00:15:48,305 --> 00:15:52,855
Wait for word from me and
don't move until then.

175
00:16:01,625 --> 00:16:05,505
I'm not a hunting dog, Bayındır.

176
00:16:07,035 --> 00:16:11,575
Tell your Sultan that she
will grant me what I want.

177
00:16:12,335 --> 00:16:15,185
What do you want but war and blood?

178
00:16:15,555 --> 00:16:19,375
I want a home and land.

179
00:16:21,505 --> 00:16:25,665
Lands that do not belong to the
Seljuk state nor to Byzantium.

180
00:16:26,195 --> 00:16:28,925
Lands that are for me and
my brothers only.

181
00:16:29,705 --> 00:16:35,755
When the war is completely over, Marmaracık
and its surroundings will belong to me.

182
00:16:36,465 --> 00:16:38,605
Only me.

183
00:16:40,435 --> 00:16:44,525
I don't have the right to
grant you this, however...

184
00:16:45,825 --> 00:16:49,585
I can convince Sultan.

185
00:16:52,865 --> 00:16:55,065
It is not enough to convince her.

186
00:16:55,395 --> 00:17:00,819
Next time you come, you will bring me a
document bearing the Sultan's seal...

187
00:17:00,819 --> 00:17:05,179
stating that Marmaracık
Castle belongs to me.

188
00:17:06,243 --> 00:17:12,325
Otherwise, I'll cut off your head then.

189
00:17:13,685 --> 00:17:19,765
Consider cutting off Osman's
head and make it happen.

190
00:17:20,983 --> 00:17:24,795
My Sultan will give you the power
greater than Marmaracık.

191
00:17:25,325 --> 00:17:27,395
Wait for the news.

192
00:17:58,185 --> 00:18:01,695
Köprühisar headquarters

193
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:20,370
There is no news of Turgut Bey.

194
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:24,600
What will we tell Osman Bey
if Turgut Bey does not come?

195
00:18:26,570 --> 00:18:34,010
We've fought many wars over the years
together with him, and he can't do such a thing.

196
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:38,100
Brothers, we were together
also in Marmaracık.

197
00:18:39,390 --> 00:18:43,500
- He shouldn't.
- He won't, but -

198
00:18:46,250 --> 00:18:48,910
Wasn't it about the castle, Konur?

199
00:18:48,970 --> 00:18:52,270
It shouldn't be about
the castle, Cerkutay.

200
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:58,720
Are you saying that the person we
depend on has turned his back on us ?

201
00:18:59,630 --> 00:19:01,780
Turgut Bey is heartbroken.

202
00:19:02,260 --> 00:19:04,140
What will someone do when
his heart is broken?

203
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:07,240
He will attack the
infidels and find his medicine.

204
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,950
Turgut Bey knows this and will come

205
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:16,330
It is up to him in the end but what we
need are catapults and siege weapons.

206
00:19:17,250 --> 00:19:20,200
It shouldn't look like he put his
hand on them like that.

207
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,730
It really shouldn't happen.

208
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:31,170
But he will take his weapon
and bring his men to join us.

209
00:19:31,320 --> 00:19:34,890
What will Osman Bey
do if he doesn't give us the catapults?

210
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:38,630
Osman Bey is coming.

211
00:19:59,730 --> 00:20:03,070
- Where are the catapults?
- Turgut Bey didn't give us the catapults.

212
00:20:07,790 --> 00:20:09,520
Turgut.

213
00:20:11,890 --> 00:20:13,610
Turgut.

214
00:20:23,780 --> 00:20:26,220
İnegöl Castle

215
00:20:34,540 --> 00:20:38,240
Mother İsmihan Sultan is coming!

216
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:49,010
You have honored İnegöl with
your presence, Mother Sultan.

217
00:21:00,180 --> 00:21:02,230
But we weren't waiting for you.

218
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:06,210
We were waiting for you
to tell us before you came.

219
00:21:06,590 --> 00:21:08,310
What happened?

220
00:21:08,500 --> 00:21:13,630
When did the Seljuks send word when
they came to their property, Turgut Bey?

221
00:21:17,340 --> 00:21:18,880
Get out.

222
00:21:29,730 --> 00:21:36,110
Many things have changed since
we took our hands off the border.

223
00:21:39,830 --> 00:21:45,340
It is certain Osman Bey's greatest
possession is İnegol Castle.

224
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:55,460
Do you want me to say
that İnegol Castle is mine?

225
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:59,230
Do you want me to stand against Osman Bey?

226
00:22:00,420 --> 00:22:02,470
He will also be angry with me.

227
00:22:02,860 --> 00:22:06,650
I will be angry with him and join your ranks.
Is this what you are aiming for?

228
00:22:10,500 --> 00:22:15,100
Mother Sultan,
this issue is a matter between brothers.

229
00:22:17,130 --> 00:22:20,560
And if you're looking for a traitor
against Osman Bey, don't come to me.

230
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:23,140
Because there is no traitor here.

231
00:22:25,730 --> 00:22:29,600
You have misunderstood me, Turgut Bey.

232
00:22:32,370 --> 00:22:35,730
I just wanted to see Osman Bey's property.

233
00:22:36,700 --> 00:22:40,450
And you are one of the
Beys of Osman Bey.

234
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:44,850
You're nothing other
than his shadow.

235
00:22:47,790 --> 00:22:51,810
Whoever stays in the shadows
gets used to the darkness.

236
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:56,900
Mother Sultan.

237
00:22:58,350 --> 00:23:04,020
I'm keeping a few of my warriors
on the way to İnegol Castle.

238
00:23:04,870 --> 00:23:08,960
I have buried many of
my brave men in the dirt.

239
00:23:09,490 --> 00:23:12,510
And I'm the one who raised
the flag over İnegol Castle.

240
00:23:14,310 --> 00:23:17,390
I heard it, Turgut Bey.

241
00:23:18,590 --> 00:23:23,640
You lost your wife and son.

242
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:31,720
And you did not betray Osman Bey
despite everything you've been through.

243
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:36,440
For this reason, I want you to be
at my side as a Bey.

244
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:45,260
You are different from Osman Bey.

245
00:23:51,100 --> 00:23:54,180
You just want your right.

246
00:23:59,730 --> 00:24:05,730
You only want the price
for the blood you shed.

247
00:24:16,580 --> 00:24:20,660
What did Osman Bey
do when you claimed your right?

248
00:24:22,420 --> 00:24:24,930
Didn't he ignore it, Turgut Bey?

249
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:30,110
Where is the price of the
blood your heroes shed?

250
00:24:35,540 --> 00:24:37,540
Come work with me, Turgut.

251
00:24:39,590 --> 00:24:41,350
Have a position in the state.

252
00:24:46,790 --> 00:24:48,090
Think deeply.

253
00:24:50,700 --> 00:24:52,000
And we will meet again.

254
00:25:07,270 --> 00:25:08,770
Turgut Bey.

255
00:25:11,310 --> 00:25:13,100
You deserve more.

256
00:25:36,470 --> 00:25:38,170
So then, Turgut!

257
00:25:41,630 --> 00:25:48,750
You betrayed me in spite of our
brotherhood for the sake of a castle.

258
00:25:50,310 --> 00:25:54,400
I forgive those who betray me, however...

259
00:25:57,150 --> 00:25:59,200
but you betrayed our calling.

260
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:06,650
I will never forgive those who exchange
the call of Islam for the idol of selfishness.

261
00:26:10,610 --> 00:26:11,910
Now...

262
00:26:17,450 --> 00:26:19,590
Everyone will check his heart out.

263
00:26:21,230 --> 00:26:23,280
You will see what is in your hearts.

264
00:26:26,660 --> 00:26:32,140
Leave if you have the same selfishness.

265
00:26:34,320 --> 00:26:40,060
Leave if you sit at
Satan's table and works with his friends.

266
00:26:42,140 --> 00:26:44,710
Leave if you do not have the
courage in your heart.

267
00:26:47,950 --> 00:26:50,010
Instead of going with the scared ones...

268
00:26:51,450 --> 00:26:53,540
I had better go alone.

269
00:26:54,110 --> 00:26:56,840
We are with you, Osman Bey.
We are with you, Osman Bey.

270
00:26:57,070 --> 00:27:02,580
Your calling is our calling.
Your calling is our calling.

271
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:10,270
If the catapults
don't come till evening...

272
00:27:12,340 --> 00:27:14,340
I shall behead Turgut Bey!

273
00:27:28,910 --> 00:27:30,750
Yenişehir

274
00:27:31,685 --> 00:27:33,005
Thank you.

275
00:28:10,985 --> 00:28:12,865
May your job be easy, Alçiçek.

276
00:28:13,225 --> 00:28:15,075
Thank you, Aktemur Bey.

277
00:28:36,415 --> 00:28:39,935
Aktemur.

278
00:28:41,405 --> 00:28:44,445
You shouldn't have set your eyes
on what's mine, Aktemur.

279
00:28:46,065 --> 00:28:47,945
Your blood became lawful for me.

280
00:29:07,055 --> 00:29:12,055
I must act quickly before
the bird flies out of its nest.

281
00:29:14,235 --> 00:29:15,805
- Hüseyin.
- Yes, my Bey.

282
00:29:16,335 --> 00:29:18,605
- Wait here.
- Yes, sir.

283
00:29:33,985 --> 00:29:37,485
- May your job be easy, Bengi Hatun.
- Thank you, Bayındır Bey.

284
00:29:39,695 --> 00:29:43,475
I'd like to talk to you if you're a little free.

285
00:29:48,145 --> 00:29:52,695
Take Esma with you and bring back the
goods that the merchants have prepared.

286
00:30:04,935 --> 00:30:08,135
So, Bayındır Bey?
What is so secretive?

287
00:30:09,385 --> 00:30:12,945
It is a matter of good, a matter of good, but...

288
00:30:17,865 --> 00:30:21,165
I know this is not the
right place, but...

289
00:30:23,215 --> 00:30:25,785
It will get more difficult if we
wait any longer.

290
00:30:27,745 --> 00:30:29,555
Speak clearly, what are you saying?

291
00:30:30,195 --> 00:30:31,695
Oh, Bengi Hatun.

292
00:30:31,785 --> 00:30:34,375
We have respected each
other for a long time.

293
00:30:35,015 --> 00:30:39,605
Öktem Bey knows me, you
know me, and I know you both.

294
00:30:43,115 --> 00:30:44,835
What I want to say is...

295
00:30:45,945 --> 00:30:48,515
that I want to propose to
your daughter, Alçiçek.

296
00:30:53,335 --> 00:30:55,245
What are you
saying, Bayındır Bey?

297
00:30:56,145 --> 00:30:58,995
You haven't said anything
like that until now.

298
00:31:00,065 --> 00:31:01,865
Where did you get this from now?

299
00:31:02,655 --> 00:31:04,355
Mother Sultan...

300
00:31:05,415 --> 00:31:09,495
She continues to say that she will never
leave here before my wedding ceremony.

301
00:31:11,325 --> 00:31:13,205
I passed the age of marriage.

302
00:31:13,865 --> 00:31:15,655
So I thought and decided...

303
00:31:15,685 --> 00:31:20,335
and I said, "Why don't you and Öktem Bey
be relatives?"

304
00:31:23,075 --> 00:31:25,545
I hope I didn't make a
mistake by doing this.

305
00:31:26,955 --> 00:31:28,795
Not at all, Bayındır Bey.

306
00:31:31,075 --> 00:31:34,785
But you should talk to Öktem Bey, not me.

307
00:31:35,405 --> 00:31:37,215
Of course, of course.

308
00:31:38,305 --> 00:31:40,415
...of course I'll talk to him, but...

309
00:31:42,055 --> 00:31:44,075
I wanted to tell you this, Bengi Hatun.

310
00:31:45,725 --> 00:31:53,575
Öktem Bey doesn't care as much about
anyone's words in this world as yours.

311
00:31:55,805 --> 00:31:59,255
Inform him of my intention.

312
00:32:00,645 --> 00:32:03,735
We'll come to ask for the girl
at a time that suits you.

313
00:32:04,655 --> 00:32:07,745
And who knows, maybe...

314
00:32:08,595 --> 00:32:11,595
We come with the Mother
Sultan to ask for Alçiçek.

315
00:32:15,335 --> 00:32:17,045
Stay healthy and well.

316
00:32:39,335 --> 00:32:43,425
Where are you going now, Alçiçek?

317
00:32:48,085 --> 00:32:53,345
Koyunhisar, Köprühisar, Lefka and Çadırlı.

318
00:32:55,635 --> 00:32:58,205
These are the places that
Osman is likely to attack.

319
00:33:00,795 --> 00:33:03,865
Lefka is the strongest place among them.

320
00:33:05,785 --> 00:33:07,515
He will not attack that place.

321
00:33:08,295 --> 00:33:10,065
But the rest of the places...

322
00:33:11,105 --> 00:33:15,085
They increased their reserves in the rest
of the castles when they lost Marmaracık.

323
00:33:15,355 --> 00:33:16,855
That is not enough.

324
00:33:17,215 --> 00:33:22,415
I'll
go to Köprühisar, and you go to Çadırlı.

325
00:33:24,355 --> 00:33:26,675
And if Osman attacks
places other than this...

326
00:33:27,745 --> 00:33:33,845
we'll unite our forces at the Black Stone
site and advance from there.

327
00:33:36,335 --> 00:33:42,105
It will make our work easier if Bayındır knows
where Osman will attack before him.

328
00:33:43,235 --> 00:33:45,295
The traitor on Osman's side.

329
00:33:48,265 --> 00:33:51,145
- Bayındır will finish him.
- Good.

330
00:33:55,795 --> 00:34:01,385
I must be sure of your loyalty
to me now, Olof.

331
00:34:04,765 --> 00:34:06,285
What do you want?

332
00:34:13,534 --> 00:34:19,034
I want you to leave paganism and become a Christian
while we fight these Muslim barbarians.

333
00:34:25,764 --> 00:34:28,264
Then I will be sure of your
faithfulness to me.

334
00:34:44,445 --> 00:34:48,815
My grandparents left their religion.

335
00:34:50,155 --> 00:34:52,255
And they converted
to Christianity.

336
00:34:53,614 --> 00:34:57,685
But I will not promise you this.

337
00:34:58,645 --> 00:35:00,405
If you succeed in this...

338
00:35:01,145 --> 00:35:03,205
You will become a loyal Byzantium soldier.

339
00:35:05,355 --> 00:35:07,645
Then you will have everything you desire.

340
00:35:09,985 --> 00:35:14,375
I showed my loyalty to
Byzantium by sacrificing my brother.

341
00:35:23,385 --> 00:35:25,205
But I will think about this.

342
00:35:54,995 --> 00:35:56,325
My Bey.

343
00:35:57,305 --> 00:36:01,505
To get past the walls, we need
the catapults in İnegöl.

344
00:36:01,565 --> 00:36:04,405
You say, the conquest does not take
place without the catapults, right?

345
00:36:04,485 --> 00:36:06,365
We'll take those catapults.

346
00:36:06,465 --> 00:36:09,305
Either by virtue or by force.

347
00:36:12,375 --> 00:36:14,105
Turgut Bey is coming.

348
00:36:40,465 --> 00:36:43,015
I told you he would come.

349
00:36:47,295 --> 00:36:48,865
He really came.

350
00:36:48,935 --> 00:36:50,285
Long live, Turgut Bey.

351
00:36:50,375 --> 00:36:51,935
Come on.

352
00:37:45,745 --> 00:37:47,995
Söğüt

353
00:37:48,895 --> 00:37:52,435
Our eyes and ears in Yenişehir are
reliable, my Sultan.

354
00:37:52,705 --> 00:37:56,285
No bird could fly there without
our knowledge.

355
00:38:10,475 --> 00:38:13,485
Hello there, Frigg.

356
00:38:22,555 --> 00:38:26,605
Obviously, our mutual friends
have introduced you to me for a long time.

357
00:38:28,995 --> 00:38:30,515
Mother Sultan.

358
00:38:39,935 --> 00:38:42,015
Here, Mother Sultan.

359
00:38:42,925 --> 00:38:46,005
The snake called Frigg is that woman.

360
00:38:47,235 --> 00:38:50,265
She fooled everyone with her
angelic face, however...

361
00:38:52,465 --> 00:38:54,225
It was revealed in front of me.

362
00:38:57,845 --> 00:39:03,505
There is no better weapon used
than a powerful snake, Bayındır.

363
00:39:24,415 --> 00:39:29,005
We will move together towards
our common goals.

364
00:39:31,045 --> 00:39:33,315
After destroying Osman...

365
00:39:33,655 --> 00:39:36,745
You will live freely as Frigg.

366
00:39:43,035 --> 00:39:45,055
As long as our interests are the same...

367
00:39:46,785 --> 00:39:53,065
Then you can be sure that I
will side with you, Mother Sultan.

368
00:40:09,915 --> 00:40:15,375
I don't need to be so sure, Frigg.

369
00:40:18,515 --> 00:40:20,315
But, you should be sure.

370
00:40:20,685 --> 00:40:28,335
So that this beautiful head of yours will remain
upon your body as long as you are at my command.

371
00:40:44,485 --> 00:40:46,345
Now hear me well.

372
00:40:47,715 --> 00:40:50,035
I've been off balance ever
since Öktem said it.

373
00:40:50,765 --> 00:40:52,345
My dreams were shattered there.

374
00:40:52,445 --> 00:40:54,655
Are your dreams shattered
for the first time?

375
00:40:55,005 --> 00:40:57,235
We went through all
those defeats together.

376
00:40:57,235 --> 00:41:01,195
As you said, you left the man who never
left you alone even in defeats alone.

377
00:41:01,295 --> 00:41:02,645
You chose this.

378
00:41:02,665 --> 00:41:06,125
You pushed me there by choosing a man who
was not with us in the conquest.

379
00:41:06,155 --> 00:41:08,415
A friend is known in distress.

380
00:41:09,065 --> 00:41:10,945
We went through a lot of things.

381
00:41:11,355 --> 00:41:13,595
You did not object to my
choices in those days.

382
00:41:13,915 --> 00:41:16,945
Now, you fail even though you passed
in difficult times.

383
00:41:18,445 --> 00:41:20,535
How long have you been
dreaming of royalty?

384
00:41:20,675 --> 00:41:23,855
Since the blood of my warriors spilled on the
soil in the conquests for years.

385
00:41:23,885 --> 00:41:25,365
Didn't Öktem's blood spill?

386
00:41:25,405 --> 00:41:27,745
You gave possession to whoever
was not present at the conquest.

387
00:41:27,795 --> 00:41:29,735
I have always been by your side.

388
00:41:29,755 --> 00:41:31,325
You chose this.

389
00:41:31,725 --> 00:41:33,285
That's your decision.

390
00:41:33,335 --> 00:41:35,115
You have no place with us.

391
00:41:43,225 --> 00:41:44,525
Yes.

392
00:41:47,675 --> 00:41:49,485
I only brought the catapults.

393
00:41:49,825 --> 00:41:51,185
Yes.

394
00:41:51,685 --> 00:41:53,755
May Allah prolong your life, Alps.

395
00:41:59,295 --> 00:42:00,995
And let your path be open.

396
00:42:01,795 --> 00:42:04,305
The path of one who seeks
conquest is always open.

397
00:42:05,685 --> 00:42:07,765
The one who goes into the dark is you.

398
00:42:08,845 --> 00:42:10,675
Let your path be open.

399
00:42:11,225 --> 00:42:13,105
Who choses the white path..

400
00:42:13,175 --> 00:42:16,175
and who chooses the black
will certainly be clarified.

401
00:42:17,255 --> 00:42:20,255
He who does not see his
mistake has no place among us.

402
00:42:23,165 --> 00:42:24,485
I...

403
00:42:26,225 --> 00:42:29,195
I leave you because of my mercy...

404
00:42:31,455 --> 00:42:33,785
to see the truth.

405
00:42:35,235 --> 00:42:37,265
If you will not see the truth...

406
00:42:37,335 --> 00:42:39,335
The truth is quite clear.

407
00:42:39,755 --> 00:42:42,495
You made a mistake in choosing the Beys
in the conquest.

408
00:42:42,515 --> 00:42:44,355
If I'm wrong, it's my fault.

409
00:42:46,335 --> 00:42:47,905
But you...

410
00:42:48,435 --> 00:42:51,155
You abandon your case
because of this mistake.

411
00:42:52,505 --> 00:42:56,365
This issue can not bear to remain
between you and yourself.

412
00:42:57,145 --> 00:42:59,365
You are giving an opportunity
to seduce Satan.

413
00:42:59,395 --> 00:43:02,095
I don't fight, Osman Bey.

414
00:43:02,365 --> 00:43:05,235
I will always pursue this blessed calling.

415
00:43:05,335 --> 00:43:07,205
I will walk alone if necessary.

416
00:43:08,275 --> 00:43:14,835
But you, if you consider that I have given up
on this cause because I am not behind you...

417
00:43:16,005 --> 00:43:17,685
It is because of your own greed.

418
00:43:17,705 --> 00:43:21,275
You are trying to walk alone the path
we should walk together.

419
00:43:26,765 --> 00:43:28,585
Let your path be open.

420
00:43:38,745 --> 00:43:40,085
Come on.

421
00:43:57,475 --> 00:43:58,855
Come on.

422
00:44:10,540 --> 00:44:13,390
We'll see many victories together, Frigg.

423
00:44:13,800 --> 00:44:17,130
I will not show modesty in
this matter, İsmihan Sultan.

424
00:44:17,620 --> 00:44:21,190
However, do not shy away from humility.

425
00:44:24,450 --> 00:44:27,310
Your life is between my lips.

426
00:44:28,290 --> 00:44:31,630
But our priority is the lives of our
common enemies, right?

427
00:44:45,610 --> 00:44:48,770
Malhu Hatun has come, Mother Sultan.

428
00:44:49,020 --> 00:44:50,820
And she would like to see you.

429
00:44:53,760 --> 00:44:55,110
Come on.

430
00:45:17,830 --> 00:45:20,570
What a pleasant visit, Malhun Hatun.

431
00:45:24,080 --> 00:45:26,970
We wante to visit, İsmihan Sultan.

432
00:45:29,500 --> 00:45:31,050
Sorry.

433
00:45:31,400 --> 00:45:35,960
Unaware of your arrival, we could not
properly accommodate you in our palace.

434
00:45:42,510 --> 00:45:48,510
But you obviously spent
a lot of time in Yenişehir.

435
00:45:54,170 --> 00:45:56,360
So much so that you got to know Marta.

436
00:46:00,430 --> 00:46:02,930
We met, yes.

437
00:46:02,970 --> 00:46:07,040
I never expected to find someone so good
and of such high quality here.

438
00:46:09,800 --> 00:46:14,810
Marta is your white face, Malhun Hatun.

439
00:46:15,550 --> 00:46:17,790
I'm trying to be nice to you, lady.

440
00:46:18,380 --> 00:46:20,920
How happy I am if I make you happy.

441
00:46:21,990 --> 00:46:23,570
Thank you.

442
00:46:23,790 --> 00:46:26,560
From now on, I always want to
see you by my side.

443
00:46:31,570 --> 00:46:33,100
And now permission is yours.

444
00:46:33,390 --> 00:46:36,980
Avcı will take care of you as he should.

445
00:46:58,290 --> 00:47:01,800
Marta has amazingly good taste.

446
00:47:02,440 --> 00:47:03,830
And she's noble.

447
00:47:04,570 --> 00:47:06,370
Unlike you.

448
00:47:11,270 --> 00:47:13,340
But I understand you very well.

449
00:47:15,740 --> 00:47:17,740
Even if you leave the tribe...

450
00:47:18,090 --> 00:47:20,130
The tribe is in you.

451
00:47:23,030 --> 00:47:30,220
I excuse your audacity in not hosting the
Mother Sultan properly because of your ignorance.

452
00:47:31,410 --> 00:47:33,690
These are the pains of
transition to civilisation.

453
00:47:35,010 --> 00:47:37,400
You'll get used to it, Malhun Hatun

454
00:47:40,030 --> 00:47:46,550
I have no doubt that you will
deserve where you are in time.

455
00:47:47,640 --> 00:47:50,350
Mother Sultan.

456
00:47:52,620 --> 00:47:57,170
We know that our judgment derives from
the strength we got from Konya.

457
00:47:58,520 --> 00:48:00,910
And you are not a guest.

458
00:48:03,260 --> 00:48:05,350
You're the owner of the place for us.

459
00:48:07,480 --> 00:48:09,350
We started nervously at the palace.

460
00:48:11,080 --> 00:48:13,820
I'm glad to know it won't last.

461
00:48:15,740 --> 00:48:21,410
Because I don't want you to get
hurt over small issues.

462
00:48:25,390 --> 00:48:27,930
Sorry, Mother Sultan.

463
00:48:29,190 --> 00:48:36,690
Osman Bey has sent these gifts as a sign
of our shame and as a sign of our loyalty to you.

464
00:48:40,260 --> 00:48:42,770
We are glad you accepted it.

465
00:48:43,660 --> 00:48:48,000
My happiness is linked to the happiness of
my people and yours.

466
00:48:48,350 --> 00:48:50,450
Of course, I take it, Malhun Hatun.

467
00:48:50,680 --> 00:48:52,010
Gladly.

468
00:48:58,190 --> 00:48:59,500
You won't agree.

469
00:49:00,630 --> 00:49:02,650
My mom won't let Bayındır to ask for me.

470
00:49:04,060 --> 00:49:05,610
No, she will.

471
00:49:06,530 --> 00:49:08,750
If Bayındır convinces her, she'll let him.

472
00:49:14,650 --> 00:49:17,160
Is Aktemur coming?

473
00:49:17,190 --> 00:49:18,930
I told him, he will come.

474
00:49:19,870 --> 00:49:22,380
But you grieve in vain, Alçiçek Hatun.

475
00:49:23,290 --> 00:49:28,070
I told you, Öktem Bey won't find
a better son-in-law than Aktemur.

476
00:49:28,360 --> 00:49:29,920
My mother does not want him.

477
00:49:30,210 --> 00:49:31,990
Don't you know my mom?

478
00:49:32,190 --> 00:49:34,750
She'll do whatever it takes
and convince my father.

479
00:49:37,420 --> 00:49:38,920
Alçiçek.

480
00:49:39,330 --> 00:49:40,420
Esma, go.

481
00:49:40,580 --> 00:49:43,090
If my mother asks
anything, distract her.

482
00:49:51,810 --> 00:49:53,160
I told you.

483
00:49:54,230 --> 00:49:56,760
We will be miserable together.

484
00:49:57,490 --> 00:49:59,820
It's time to be miserable, Aktemur.

485
00:49:59,890 --> 00:50:02,110
What happened, Alçiçek?
What do you mean?

486
00:50:02,130 --> 00:50:03,860
Esma heard that...

487
00:50:05,380 --> 00:50:07,680
one of them went to my mother
and asked for me.

488
00:50:08,510 --> 00:50:11,550
From? And what did he ask, Alçiçek?
What do you say?

489
00:50:11,560 --> 00:50:12,930
What do you not understand?

490
00:50:12,970 --> 00:50:15,010
One of the Beys
wants to marry me.

491
00:50:15,020 --> 00:50:17,070
I'm telling you, Aktemur.

492
00:50:21,150 --> 00:50:22,350
Say it, who is he?

493
00:50:22,380 --> 00:50:24,560
What are you going to do?

494
00:50:24,600 --> 00:50:26,190
This is not our problem.

495
00:50:26,270 --> 00:50:28,350
I told you who he is, Alçiçek?

496
00:50:28,960 --> 00:50:31,670
Who is looking at my sweetheart
with a deviant eye?

497
00:50:31,720 --> 00:50:33,030
Tell me.

498
00:50:37,590 --> 00:50:39,110
Bayındır Bey.

499
00:50:41,600 --> 00:50:44,130
He said the name of the Mother Sultan...

500
00:50:44,660 --> 00:50:46,230
to convince my mother.

501
00:50:46,360 --> 00:50:49,920
If my mother is convinced, my
father will be convinced, Aktemur.

502
00:50:51,290 --> 00:50:52,800
Bayındır.

503
00:50:53,300 --> 00:50:54,730
I will find him.

504
00:50:54,780 --> 00:50:56,820
Stop, wait.

505
00:50:57,200 --> 00:50:59,050
It can't be like this, Aktemur.

506
00:51:05,090 --> 00:51:07,180
I tell you that İsmihan
Sultan is behind him.

507
00:51:08,390 --> 00:51:10,230
You will bring yourself trouble.

508
00:51:10,530 --> 00:51:12,280
What do we do now?

509
00:51:16,690 --> 00:51:19,210
I'm going to root this out
today, Alçiçek Hatun.

510
00:51:19,300 --> 00:51:20,640
Let's go.

511
00:51:20,670 --> 00:51:22,220
Where are we going?

512
00:51:22,270 --> 00:51:24,310
We'll go to my uncle's.

513
00:51:33,640 --> 00:51:35,700
Aktemur.

514
00:51:36,810 --> 00:51:39,180
I will end you.

515
00:51:40,440 --> 00:51:42,940
Come on, Hüseyin, let's go
after them quickly.

516
00:52:39,050 --> 00:52:40,750
You will attack the enemy.

517
00:52:40,850 --> 00:52:42,360
What's the matter?

518
00:52:42,410 --> 00:52:43,800
Go!

519
00:52:48,570 --> 00:52:49,880
Come.

520
00:52:58,370 --> 00:52:59,680
You are...

521
00:53:00,120 --> 00:53:02,590
You will strike as if you
were hitting the enemy.

522
00:53:06,870 --> 00:53:08,610
How are you doing this?

523
00:53:08,930 --> 00:53:10,630
How are you doing this?

524
00:53:10,630 --> 00:53:12,670
We'll go to war, war!

525
00:53:14,420 --> 00:53:16,430
You will die for one mistake!

526
00:53:16,490 --> 00:53:18,060
- Osman.
- I'm talking to you.

527
00:53:18,120 --> 00:53:19,330
My Osman!

528
00:53:19,370 --> 00:53:21,840
My Osman, come and rest a bit.

529
00:53:22,800 --> 00:53:23,970
Drink water.

530
00:53:25,250 --> 00:53:27,400
Come on, come on, my dear Osman.

531
00:53:27,650 --> 00:53:29,170
Come on.

532
00:53:42,270 --> 00:53:44,070
Tell me, my dear Osman.

533
00:53:50,720 --> 00:53:53,300
Is Turgut Bey the reason for
all your anger, dear Osman?

534
00:53:59,550 --> 00:54:02,700
The greed of the world has entered
among my warriors and Beys.

535
00:54:03,450 --> 00:54:08,320
Turgut, who fought us shoulder to shoulder
all those years ago...

536
00:54:08,550 --> 00:54:11,370
deviates from our path now for just
a castle.

537
00:54:11,850 --> 00:54:14,220
Bala, is there anything more
dangerous than this?

538
00:54:14,220 --> 00:54:15,720
Tell me, is there?

539
00:54:15,720 --> 00:54:19,000
Inshallah, you will overcome
this danger, my dear Osman.

540
00:54:20,170 --> 00:54:24,920
Well, what about my Beys and my Alps?
What if they were defeated in front of these ambitions?

541
00:54:24,970 --> 00:54:26,470
What will happen then?

542
00:54:26,500 --> 00:54:28,100
We'll get through
this, my dear Osman.

543
00:54:28,120 --> 00:54:30,070
We will get over this, Inshallah.

544
00:54:30,370 --> 00:54:31,750
We will pray to Allah.

545
00:54:31,750 --> 00:54:33,030
And we'll be careful.

546
00:54:33,130 --> 00:54:36,040
We will not fall into the
temptation of Satan, Inshallah.

547
00:54:36,350 --> 00:54:37,770
It's true what you say.

548
00:54:37,840 --> 00:54:40,920
I was determined to walk this path
even if I was alone.

549
00:54:41,000 --> 00:54:43,870
Dear Osman, you are not alone.

550
00:54:44,870 --> 00:54:47,870
Know that I will follow
you wherever you go.

551
00:54:48,470 --> 00:54:51,550
Point to the target and
we will march to it.

552
00:54:52,000 --> 00:54:56,270
It is enough for us to walk together
toward conquest and martyrdom.

553
00:54:58,520 --> 00:55:00,460
I know, dear Bala, I know.

554
00:55:00,470 --> 00:55:02,470
I consider that you and I are one.

555
00:55:03,650 --> 00:55:05,720
But what we saw today...

556
00:55:06,420 --> 00:55:08,950
It shows us that we are not alone
on this road anymore.

557
00:55:09,000 --> 00:55:11,500
For this reason, we have to do a lot.

558
00:55:12,020 --> 00:55:13,400
Lots.

559
00:55:16,020 --> 00:55:19,570
My Bey, Aktemur Bey
and Alçiçek Hatun are coming.

560
00:55:31,900 --> 00:55:34,470
Are they coming here?

561
00:55:37,000 --> 00:55:39,500
What is this, Osman Bey?

562
00:55:42,920 --> 00:55:45,970
You have set the
military headquarters here.

563
00:55:47,250 --> 00:55:48,800
Salam Alaikum.

564
00:55:49,370 --> 00:55:50,950
Alaikum Salam.

565
00:56:01,000 --> 00:56:04,040
Look at Aktemur.

566
00:56:04,150 --> 00:56:06,500
He tells his uncle about it at once.

567
00:56:08,300 --> 00:56:11,300
Now they will ask for the girl at once.

568
00:56:12,100 --> 00:56:15,600
Is it possible that I leave
you what is mine?

569
00:56:16,050 --> 00:56:17,320
Hüseyin.

570
00:56:17,370 --> 00:56:19,550
- My Bey.
- Let's go right away.

571
00:56:19,970 --> 00:56:23,750
If they see us here, they
won't leave us alive.

572
00:56:23,750 --> 00:56:25,300
It is true what you say, my Bey.

573
00:56:25,300 --> 00:56:26,650
Come on.

574
00:56:31,320 --> 00:56:32,900
Bala.

575
00:56:35,220 --> 00:56:36,920
Let's go, Alçiçek.

576
00:56:46,640 --> 00:56:51,240
It seemed like it mattered as you brought
Alçiçek here.

577
00:56:51,440 --> 00:56:52,810
Yes, it is important.

578
00:56:52,870 --> 00:56:54,190
My uncle.

579
00:56:54,720 --> 00:56:58,040
Didn't you ask me if Alçiçek
loves me, too?

580
00:56:58,320 --> 00:57:00,270
I knew the answer to that question.

581
00:57:00,340 --> 00:57:02,270
Her answer is clear, son.

582
00:57:02,340 --> 00:57:04,340
We all saw it and believed it.

583
00:57:05,520 --> 00:57:07,890
But now there is something else.

584
00:57:11,170 --> 00:57:14,040
One of the Beys intends to
propose to Alçiçek for marriage.

585
00:57:17,240 --> 00:57:18,570
Who is he?

586
00:57:18,620 --> 00:57:19,990
Who is he?

587
00:57:20,820 --> 00:57:22,170
Bayındır.

588
00:57:23,140 --> 00:57:25,640
He said it himself.

589
00:57:26,320 --> 00:57:30,120
He says that İsmihan Sultan
is standing behind him.

590
00:57:33,470 --> 00:57:35,040
Bayındır.

591
00:57:36,490 --> 00:57:38,190
Bayındır.

592
00:57:40,990 --> 00:57:43,990
Alçiçek, forgive me.

593
00:57:44,820 --> 00:57:46,190
That slap...

594
00:57:47,690 --> 00:57:49,820
When I saw Aktemur in that
state with blood all over him...

595
00:57:49,870 --> 00:57:52,760
I forgive you for my right.

596
00:57:52,820 --> 00:57:55,180
Whoever was in your position
would have done the same.

597
00:57:55,220 --> 00:57:56,920
I'm not upset.

598
00:57:57,470 --> 00:58:01,190
But I would like to
join the women warriors.

599
00:58:01,770 --> 00:58:03,090
Thank you.

600
00:58:03,640 --> 00:58:07,140
Let's do your wedding.

601
00:58:08,940 --> 00:58:10,390
Then we will discuss this.

602
00:58:15,340 --> 00:58:20,040
I'm not worried about
my father, but my mother.

603
00:58:21,170 --> 00:58:23,970
You know she doesn't get along
with Ayşe Hatun.

604
00:58:26,670 --> 00:58:30,730
Don't be afraid, these are
small things in front of love.

605
00:58:31,060 --> 00:58:33,060
They will all be resolved.

606
00:58:37,290 --> 00:58:39,370
His intention is to
make a trouble.

607
00:58:39,640 --> 00:58:43,490
He wants to unite with Öktem
and prevail before us.

608
00:58:46,070 --> 00:58:51,670
Uncle, I kept you busy with my problems
before such an important conquest.

609
00:58:51,740 --> 00:58:52,940
No, my nephew.

610
00:58:53,270 --> 00:58:56,240
You have opened a heart, is this possible?

611
00:58:56,240 --> 00:58:58,240
We'll go ask for the girl.

612
00:58:58,340 --> 00:59:02,920
And I will do my duty as your uncle.

613
00:59:07,120 --> 00:59:08,620
My Bey.

614
00:59:09,120 --> 00:59:10,840
There is another issue yet.

615
00:59:11,390 --> 00:59:13,190
They spread men everywhere.

616
00:59:14,120 --> 00:59:16,440
They obviously know
you're not in Yenişehir.

617
00:59:17,170 --> 00:59:18,690
They are looking for you.

618
00:59:18,970 --> 00:59:22,190
Well then, let's go and show
them ourselves.

619
00:59:22,190 --> 00:59:24,190
And we ask for our girl.

620
00:59:24,970 --> 00:59:26,520
Bala.

621
00:59:33,190 --> 00:59:35,100
We will go to Yenişehir.

622
00:59:35,130 --> 00:59:38,920
We'll go to Marmaracık to ask for Alçiçek
before the conquest.

623
00:59:50,070 --> 00:59:51,620
Oğuz Alp.

624
00:59:53,070 --> 00:59:55,420
- My Bey.
- Send word to Öktem Bey.

625
00:59:55,890 --> 00:59:58,220
We're coming to him
for something good.

626
00:59:58,470 --> 00:59:59,970
Your command, my Beyç

627
01:00:07,890 --> 01:00:09,270
Son.

628
01:00:09,570 --> 01:00:12,640
Bala.
Come on.

629
01:00:25,750 --> 01:00:30,030
We now know the location of
Osman's military headquarters.

630
01:00:30,730 --> 01:00:35,680
He can't take a step in Köpruhisar
without this headquarters.

631
01:00:38,780 --> 01:00:40,550
Nice.

632
01:00:41,600 --> 01:00:43,350
Very nice.

633
01:00:45,300 --> 01:00:48,400
But you don't seem
to get too excited about it, Bayındır.

634
01:00:51,600 --> 01:00:53,130
Not at all.

635
01:00:53,880 --> 01:00:55,340
Of course I am happy.

636
01:00:55,380 --> 01:00:59,150
We found Osman's hole, of
course I'm happy.

637
01:00:59,680 --> 01:01:01,550
However...

638
01:01:03,850 --> 01:01:05,810
There is another issue yet.

639
01:01:05,850 --> 01:01:07,850
Mother Sultan.

640
01:01:10,780 --> 01:01:14,930
Osman will ask for a girl for his nephew.

641
01:01:15,630 --> 01:01:18,130
What do we have to do with this?

642
01:01:21,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Yes, you're right but...

643
01:01:26,530 --> 01:01:31,100
Osman will ask for Öktem
Bey's daughter, Alçiçek Hatun.

644
01:01:40,680 --> 01:01:45,830
This marriage will
strengthen Osman internally.

645
01:01:47,300 --> 01:01:50,030
And he will gather all the tribes.

646
01:01:54,300 --> 01:01:56,500
And there is Marmaracık, of course.

647
01:01:58,780 --> 01:02:01,800
Is that what's bothering you, Bayındır?

648
01:02:03,450 --> 01:02:05,000
You...

649
01:02:05,080 --> 01:02:07,800
I want Alçiçek Hatun
for myself, my Sultan.

650
01:02:09,250 --> 01:02:12,550
Obviously, Osman will act
quickly and ask for the girl.

651
01:02:13,380 --> 01:02:16,530
Let's go before him and take
the girl, my Sultan.

652
01:02:19,900 --> 01:02:21,480
Love matters.

653
01:02:23,650 --> 01:02:25,000
I understood.

654
01:02:34,050 --> 01:02:39,050
Alçiçek will be your wife.
This is what Mother Sultan ordered.

655
01:02:39,450 --> 01:02:42,230
May Allah be pleased with you, my Sultan.

656
01:02:42,550 --> 01:02:44,650
Stand up, Bayındır.

657
01:02:44,650 --> 01:02:46,650
Stand up.

658
01:02:53,380 --> 01:02:55,880
And send word to Olof and
the others at once.

659
01:02:56,180 --> 01:02:59,450
Describe to them the location of the
military headquarters well.

660
01:02:59,680 --> 01:03:03,730
And tell them to destroy that headquarters...

661
01:03:03,730 --> 01:03:05,730
with whoever is inside it.

662
01:03:12,650 --> 01:03:14,650
And Osman too?

663
01:03:15,480 --> 01:03:19,200
An army without a leader is considered
non-existent, Bayındır.

664
01:03:19,400 --> 01:03:23,200
We must finish off Osman
and scatter his army.

665
01:03:23,900 --> 01:03:27,400
And I thought of something different
for Osman.

666
01:03:28,500 --> 01:03:34,080
He and his dear wife Malhun
will be my guests tonight.

667
01:03:35,030 --> 01:03:40,050
You, in the meantime, will be a
man engaged to Alçiçek.

668
01:03:41,380 --> 01:03:46,900
My Sultan, I will send
Hüseyin to Olof but...

669
01:03:47,880 --> 01:03:50,200
Olof doesn't do it for nothing.

670
01:03:51,030 --> 01:03:54,030
He wants Marmaracık.

671
01:03:55,300 --> 01:03:57,500
They must ask for it.

672
01:03:58,850 --> 01:04:01,630
Greedy creatures.

673
01:04:06,630 --> 01:04:08,630
Tell them not to worry.

674
01:04:10,130 --> 01:04:12,700
They will get what they want.

675
01:04:59,000 --> 01:05:00,630
What happened, my Bey?

676
01:05:00,690 --> 01:05:02,840
Is there a problem before the conquest?

677
01:05:02,950 --> 01:05:04,950
Good, good.

678
01:05:05,400 --> 01:05:10,430
We'll conquer a heart before the castle.

679
01:05:15,380 --> 01:05:17,250
Do the preparations.

680
01:05:18,730 --> 01:05:21,750
We'll ask for Alçiçek for Aktemur.

681
01:05:30,030 --> 01:05:32,780
I'm so happy, Aktemur.

682
01:05:43,700 --> 01:05:45,430
Ayşe Hatun.

683
01:05:46,100 --> 01:05:48,510
We sent word like this
without asking you, however...

684
01:05:48,540 --> 01:05:50,040
excuse us.

685
01:05:50,230 --> 01:05:52,050
It's okay, my Bey.

686
01:05:52,130 --> 01:05:54,630
Whatever we say is not important.

687
01:05:56,150 --> 01:06:01,000
If Gündüz was alive, he would have
made the decision you made.

688
01:06:02,900 --> 01:06:04,400
May Allah bless you.

689
01:06:17,250 --> 01:06:19,330
Come on, let's get ready.

690
01:06:20,230 --> 01:06:23,580
I said it.

691
01:06:59,600 --> 01:07:00,950
Mother.

692
01:07:03,150 --> 01:07:06,200
Aktemur Bey, I'm happy for you.

693
01:07:08,400 --> 01:07:09,790
Don't act like that, mother.

694
01:07:09,820 --> 01:07:11,350
Aktemur.

695
01:07:11,410 --> 01:07:17,410
How could you do such a thing without
consulting me and taking my permission?

696
01:07:17,580 --> 01:07:22,350
You've run me over
with your behaviour.

697
01:07:25,200 --> 01:07:27,030
What are you saying, mother?

698
01:07:28,050 --> 01:07:29,900
Don't act like that.

699
01:07:30,600 --> 01:07:31,980
- I was...
- No!

700
01:07:32,060 --> 01:07:34,380
Go and ask for her with your uncle.

701
01:07:34,700 --> 01:07:36,700
I will not go to that palace.

702
01:07:38,280 --> 01:07:39,780
Bayındır.

703
01:07:44,480 --> 01:07:46,830
He will ask for Alçiçek.

704
01:07:52,230 --> 01:07:54,230
I can't live without her, mother.

705
01:07:55,850 --> 01:07:57,600
I was forced.

706
01:07:58,630 --> 01:08:02,790
Is it reasonable for me to do something
like this without your permission?

707
01:08:05,580 --> 01:08:07,770
Don't leave me alone on a day like this

708
01:08:10,250 --> 01:08:11,830
Aktemur.

709
01:08:12,550 --> 01:08:15,100
You say you can't live without her.

710
01:08:15,600 --> 01:08:18,130
Do you really love her that much?

711
01:08:21,399 --> 01:08:23,399
And what about her?

712
01:08:26,080 --> 01:08:27,950
Does she love you too?

713
01:08:28,000 --> 01:08:30,080
Or else why would she run to notify me?

714
01:08:30,399 --> 01:08:33,149
She also loves me as much as
I love her, mother!

715
01:08:35,279 --> 01:08:36,979
You will come, right?

716
01:08:37,399 --> 01:08:40,729
Son, I see your love.

717
01:08:41,399 --> 01:08:45,100
But I don't believe in that girl's love.

718
01:08:46,000 --> 01:08:48,130
A lover never neglects her beloved,
Aktemur.

719
01:08:49,830 --> 01:08:51,830
Don't you trust my words, Mother.

720
01:08:53,350 --> 01:08:55,380
I'm telling you, Alcicek loves me back!

721
01:08:57,850 --> 01:09:00,180
I see love in her eyes.

722
01:09:01,550 --> 01:09:03,399
Come on, mother!

723
01:09:04,229 --> 01:09:06,479
Don't leave me alone on a day like this.

724
01:09:14,950 --> 01:09:17,500
Marmaracik Castle

725
01:09:18,350 --> 01:09:20,479
You said they had
no intention of doing so.

726
01:09:20,479 --> 01:09:22,850
Osman Bey is coming to ask for Alcicek.

727
01:09:24,050 --> 01:09:25,910
You wouldn't permit, would you Oktem?

728
01:09:26,279 --> 01:09:29,200
It's Osman Bey!
Osman Bey, the Bey of these lands!

729
01:09:29,200 --> 01:09:32,029
The Bey who made Marmaracik home!

730
01:09:32,250 --> 01:09:33,750
Osman Bey!

731
01:09:33,850 --> 01:09:36,930
What will I tell him when
he stands on my doorstep?

732
01:09:37,800 --> 01:09:40,350
If Alcicek agrees,
there's nothing else to do.

733
01:09:40,350 --> 01:09:42,350
I told you not to permit, Oktem!

734
01:09:42,350 --> 01:09:43,880
I will, Hatun!

735
01:09:43,880 --> 01:09:45,450
You will not!

736
01:09:46,200 --> 01:09:49,550
Oktem, I won't give my daughter
to Subasi.

737
01:09:49,550 --> 01:09:51,550
Those Kayis killed my brother.

738
01:09:52,279 --> 01:09:54,149
We suffered due to them!

739
01:09:54,149 --> 01:09:56,150
I can't forget that.

740
01:09:56,150 --> 01:09:58,480
Enough, Hatun, enough!

741
01:09:59,030 --> 01:10:01,080
I will not listen to you!

742
01:10:01,080 --> 01:10:03,530
I'll give Alcicek to Aktemur!

743
01:10:03,530 --> 01:10:06,980
Attention, Mother Isfihan Sultan.

744
01:10:15,780 --> 01:10:18,130
Will you, Oktem Bey?

745
01:10:27,930 --> 01:10:30,430
What if I ask for Alcicek?

746
01:10:34,000 --> 01:10:35,700
What will you do then?

747
01:10:39,050 --> 01:10:43,080
Will you give your daughter to Osman Bey
and not to me?

748
01:10:55,340 --> 01:10:57,630
Yenisehir
Osman Bey's Mansion

749
01:11:25,980 --> 01:11:28,320
Ulgen Hatun.

750
01:11:29,910 --> 01:11:33,000
I'm calling you Ulgen Hatun!

751
01:11:34,610 --> 01:11:37,990
Don't you hear me?

752
01:11:38,290 --> 01:11:40,550
I am deaf.

753
01:11:41,130 --> 01:11:43,160
Deaf!

754
01:11:57,120 --> 01:11:59,830
Ulgen Hatun.

755
01:12:00,450 --> 01:12:03,180
I didn't want to offend you.

756
01:12:03,370 --> 01:12:04,960
Forgive me.

757
01:12:05,050 --> 01:12:08,100
"I didn't want to offend you"

758
01:12:08,290 --> 01:12:14,320
You made fun of me, all those people knew
you could hear. You made fun of me!

759
01:12:14,490 --> 01:12:16,540
Who knows what they thought about me!?

760
01:12:16,760 --> 01:12:21,780
From now on, I will not see or hear you
Cerkutay Alp!

761
01:12:24,470 --> 01:12:28,050
Aren't you going to give me food?

762
01:12:28,370 --> 01:12:31,900
I will kill you, I swear to Allah!
No!

763
01:12:36,180 --> 01:12:39,570
Are you eating food Cerkutay, huh?

764
01:12:41,340 --> 01:12:44,870
- Hi sister Ulgen.
- Welcome.

765
01:12:45,110 --> 01:12:47,410
Give me some food, will you?

766
01:12:47,590 --> 01:12:49,310
Sure, sure

767
01:12:49,590 --> 01:12:51,170
I'm hungry.

768
01:13:17,450 --> 01:13:19,610
Great job, sister Ulgen.

769
01:13:19,660 --> 01:13:21,530
- Enjoy it.
- Enjoy it brother.

770
01:13:21,530 --> 01:13:24,760
You enjoy too, brother.

771
01:13:28,320 --> 01:13:30,620
Don't do this to me.

772
01:13:31,500 --> 01:13:35,080
Don't do this to me.

773
01:13:36,430 --> 01:13:38,580
This amount can't satisfy anyone!

774
01:13:38,810 --> 01:13:42,140
Enjoy it Boran Alp!
Enjoy it!

775
01:13:42,290 --> 01:13:45,240
You'll eat as much as I give you,
there's no more!

776
01:13:46,020 --> 01:13:48,370
Are you telling me to stay hungry?

777
01:13:48,470 --> 01:13:50,770
From now on, eating your fill
is haram for you!

778
01:13:51,800 --> 01:13:53,600
I'll leave then!

779
01:13:53,950 --> 01:13:56,030
Look, I said I'll go!

780
01:13:56,630 --> 01:13:59,010
Who am I talking to?

781
01:14:00,160 --> 01:14:01,460
No.

782
01:14:02,110 --> 01:14:05,300
I am deaf, deaf.

783
01:14:07,145 --> 01:14:08,675
I am deaf.

784
01:14:11,050 --> 01:14:14,130
- I am leaving.
- Go away.

785
01:14:14,280 --> 01:14:17,380
- Leaving hungry.
- May your fight be blessed. Go.

786
01:14:17,480 --> 01:14:22,490
- I am going to war.
- Go wherever you go.

787
01:14:22,820 --> 01:14:25,040
I can't help it.

788
01:14:25,870 --> 01:14:28,100
How am I...

789
01:14:28,320 --> 01:14:34,180
...going to stab my enemies in the heart!

790
01:14:34,360 --> 01:14:36,610
Enemies will stab you instead!

791
01:14:36,740 --> 01:14:39,040
Think about what you have done to me!

792
01:14:42,540 --> 01:14:47,250
Tawbah tawbah!
I didn't mean this! My Allah!

793
01:14:47,900 --> 01:14:52,310
Ah Cerkutay Ah!

794
01:14:54,830 --> 01:14:59,840
What have I done to deserve this?

795
01:15:01,740 --> 01:15:03,750
Cerkutay.

796
01:15:04,450 --> 01:15:06,330
What are you doing brother?

797
01:15:06,730 --> 01:15:08,800
Yes brother, what am I doing?

798
01:15:12,230 --> 01:15:15,240
I think I lost my mind because of hunger.

799
01:15:15,860 --> 01:15:18,240
She doesn't give me food.

800
01:15:18,670 --> 01:15:20,190
Let me, brother.

801
01:15:22,700 --> 01:15:25,700
Ah Cerkutay ah!

802
01:15:29,310 --> 01:15:34,490
Ah, they'll defeat me brother Boran!

803
01:15:34,710 --> 01:15:37,990
What am I going to do, brother?

804
01:15:46,960 --> 01:15:50,590
They'll defeat me brother Boran!

805
01:15:54,690 --> 01:15:56,770
What can I say, Ismahan Sultan?

806
01:15:59,900 --> 01:16:02,150
You tied me up.

807
01:16:02,400 --> 01:16:05,410
I didn't do anything, Oktem Bey.

808
01:16:11,210 --> 01:16:15,720
Before Osman Bey,
Bayindir Bey knocked your door.

809
01:16:16,050 --> 01:16:18,770
And now, as being the mother Sultan...

810
01:16:19,000 --> 01:16:21,150
...I ask for your daughter.

811
01:16:28,340 --> 01:16:33,690
I was glad to be Oktem Bey's relative.

812
01:16:33,940 --> 01:16:38,280
But it seems like he doesn't want us.

813
01:16:38,530 --> 01:16:41,330
Not at all, Bayindir Bey.

814
01:16:41,630 --> 01:16:43,230
It is not like how you think.

815
01:16:43,610 --> 01:16:46,760
We trust you completely.

816
01:16:51,370 --> 01:16:53,250
Don't we, Oktem Bey?

817
01:16:53,620 --> 01:16:56,800
Can we find someone
better than Bayindir Bey?

818
01:16:57,930 --> 01:17:00,130
Right.

819
01:17:00,310 --> 01:17:02,160
Right, but...

820
01:17:02,880 --> 01:17:07,160
- Osman Bey...
- Osman Bey is such a hard head.

821
01:17:08,320 --> 01:17:09,870
He is a rebel.

822
01:17:11,500 --> 01:17:17,950
You all know what the end of this rebellion is.

823
01:17:18,580 --> 01:17:23,160
I mean, Osman Bey is present today
but he may not be tomorrow.

824
01:17:23,390 --> 01:17:28,420
But we are here forever, Oktem Bey.

825
01:17:30,370 --> 01:17:32,920
And I support Bayindir Bey.

826
01:17:38,310 --> 01:17:40,110
First of all...

827
01:17:41,390 --> 01:17:43,960
I have to ask Alcicek.

828
01:17:46,490 --> 01:17:50,720
Of course you will, Oktem Bey.

829
01:17:50,950 --> 01:17:53,480
Of course you will but...

830
01:17:54,530 --> 01:17:59,310
If Alcicek is as smart as her mother...

831
01:18:01,660 --> 01:18:05,170
...she must know the answer.

832
01:18:08,800 --> 01:18:12,650
Alcicek's answer is apparent,
Ismihan Sultan.

833
01:18:13,350 --> 01:18:15,860
Alcicek will agree.

834
01:18:29,400 --> 01:18:31,880
You're too late, Aktemur.

835
01:18:34,510 --> 01:18:36,790
You are too late!

836
01:19:34,210 --> 01:19:36,720
Welcome.

837
01:19:52,640 --> 01:19:57,960
By Allah's command and in accordance with
the tradition of the Messenger of Allah...

838
01:19:57,960 --> 01:20:01,960
...we ask your daughter Alcicek
in marriage with Bayindir Bey.

839
01:20:17,180 --> 01:20:19,510
Osman Bey.

840
01:20:25,740 --> 01:20:27,870
What's happening here?

841
01:20:31,750 --> 01:20:33,880
Oktem Bey.

842
01:20:35,500 --> 01:20:37,760
Haven't we informed you?

843
01:20:37,980 --> 01:20:39,860
What is this situation?

844
01:20:40,210 --> 01:20:43,760
You tell us what is happening, Osman Bey!

845
01:20:46,190 --> 01:20:48,800
Entering without permission.

846
01:20:49,100 --> 01:20:52,200
We abode by the tradition.
We sent the news before we came.

847
01:20:52,500 --> 01:20:58,530
Apparently, you are the one who came
without informing, Isfahan Sultan.

848
01:21:00,810 --> 01:21:05,840
I don't have to inform my people and
my land before visiting them!

849
01:21:19,260 --> 01:21:22,140
I asked a question for you, Oktem Bey.

850
01:21:22,470 --> 01:21:24,520
What is your answer?

851
01:21:34,810 --> 01:21:39,840
Oktem Bey invited us to hear this answer.

852
01:21:40,320 --> 01:21:44,200
Say it then. Say it.

853
01:21:45,120 --> 01:21:47,330
Osman Bey.

854
01:21:48,400 --> 01:21:51,960
- We didn't know.
- Oktem Bey is right.

855
01:21:52,430 --> 01:21:54,180
We are here for something good.

856
01:21:54,380 --> 01:21:56,890
We came and asked for marriage.

857
01:22:01,390 --> 01:22:03,970
And we will get what we want, Inshallah.

858
01:22:04,320 --> 01:22:07,650
Am I right, Oktem Bey?

859
01:22:30,760 --> 01:22:32,620
I give my daughter to Bayindir Bey.

860
01:22:47,270 --> 01:22:48,790
Congratulations.

861
01:23:19,110 --> 01:23:23,300
Oktem Bey, we came here to open hearts.

862
01:23:25,370 --> 01:23:27,370
We came to establish a family.

863
01:23:28,210 --> 01:23:30,440
It certainly won't be
difficult for us to return.

864
01:23:37,220 --> 01:23:39,240
Does Alcicek consent to this?

865
01:23:39,250 --> 01:23:41,500
Her mother is here and her father is here.

866
01:23:44,970 --> 01:23:47,420
We are not giving her by force,
are we Osman Bey?

867
01:23:47,850 --> 01:23:50,410
Do you think we are tyrant?

868
01:23:56,710 --> 01:23:58,560
Shame on you Osman Bey.

869
01:24:01,330 --> 01:24:04,650
How could someone be forced
to do such a good thing.

870
01:24:07,770 --> 01:24:11,270
Now if you excuse,
we'll talk about our wedding.

871
01:24:16,980 --> 01:24:21,370
Also, I want to host you
with your family and Beys...

872
01:24:22,010 --> 01:24:24,200
...in Soguthan.

873
01:24:26,710 --> 01:24:29,720
Sultan Aladdin has important news.

874
01:25:02,470 --> 01:25:04,060
Aktemur.

875
01:25:10,390 --> 01:25:12,950
- Alcicek, I...
- Shut up.

876
01:25:14,710 --> 01:25:16,230
Listen to me.

877
01:25:19,270 --> 01:25:21,060
I do not want Bayindir.

878
01:25:22,660 --> 01:25:23,980
Do you...

879
01:25:24,290 --> 01:25:26,490
Do you still want to marry me?

880
01:25:27,590 --> 01:25:29,660
I don't just want to marry you.

881
01:25:29,800 --> 01:25:33,400
I want to grow old and die with you Alcicek!

882
01:25:35,400 --> 01:25:37,290
There is only one solution now.

883
01:25:37,320 --> 01:25:39,190
We have to elope tomorrow!

884
01:25:41,090 --> 01:25:42,680
I'll come, Alcicek Hatun.

885
01:25:42,680 --> 01:25:46,420
I will come to get you out of this hell
even if my hands are covered in blood!

886
01:25:46,420 --> 01:25:50,350
I'll wait for you under the crooked tree
at Camlik.

887
01:25:53,110 --> 01:25:55,620
Come on, they'll understand.

888
01:26:05,550 --> 01:26:08,770
Kopru Hisar.

889
01:26:15,000 --> 01:26:16,810
The walls are covered.

890
01:26:17,500 --> 01:26:20,080
Trenches were dug around the castle.

891
01:26:20,170 --> 01:26:23,820
Now whoever tries to attack can't
get past the walls, Olof

892
01:26:23,820 --> 01:26:25,340
Nice.

893
01:26:25,880 --> 01:26:27,770
Deploy the soldiers.

894
01:26:28,420 --> 01:26:29,990
Nobody shall sleep.

895
01:26:34,820 --> 01:26:36,880
Bayindir's man has come, Olof.

896
01:26:38,200 --> 01:26:39,540
Let him in.

897
01:26:56,260 --> 01:26:58,120
Bayindir Bey sent me.

898
01:26:58,780 --> 01:27:01,140
This shows the location
of Osman's headquarters

899
01:27:02,240 --> 01:27:03,550
So what?

900
01:27:03,550 --> 01:27:06,750
So, this is the order of Ismihan Sultan.

901
01:27:07,300 --> 01:27:10,890
She orders you to destroy the headquarters
tomorrow night.

902
01:27:13,620 --> 01:27:15,140
In return of what?

903
01:27:15,140 --> 01:27:18,020
Sultan says you will have
something in return.

904
01:27:22,340 --> 01:27:24,860
The headquarters is near Kopruhisar.

905
01:27:26,150 --> 01:27:27,880
At Taspinar.

906
01:27:29,690 --> 01:27:32,660
If you fail destroy the headquarters.

907
01:27:33,620 --> 01:27:37,620
You will end up like
how you did in Marmaracik.

908
01:27:40,950 --> 01:27:42,970
Leave him Dan.

909
01:27:49,270 --> 01:27:51,670
I will kill thousands of
birds with one stone.

910
01:27:52,780 --> 01:27:55,220
I will both get Marmaracik back...

911
01:27:55,460 --> 01:27:59,750
...and take everything Osman has.

912
01:28:15,580 --> 01:28:18,080
Do you think Osman Bey
will come tomorrow night?

913
01:28:18,660 --> 01:28:21,230
He will, Avci.
He will.

914
01:28:22,630 --> 01:28:24,520
They obeyed me today.

915
01:28:26,220 --> 01:28:30,540
No one can refuse
the invitation of Mother Sultan.

916
01:28:34,660 --> 01:28:37,000
- Are the gifts ready?
- Yes my Sultan.

917
01:28:37,460 --> 01:28:41,910
I have prepared two white horses for
Orhan and Aladdin Beys.

918
01:28:42,300 --> 01:28:43,840
Two horses?

919
01:28:45,340 --> 01:28:48,420
No, Avci, not two horses.

920
01:28:49,140 --> 01:28:51,000
We'll gift them one horse.

921
01:28:53,700 --> 01:28:56,600
What is the greatest weakness of mothers?

922
01:29:00,200 --> 01:29:01,720
Why am I here, Avci?

923
01:29:03,400 --> 01:29:04,750
Because I am a mother.

924
01:29:06,840 --> 01:29:10,220
And the biggest weakness of
Bala Hatun and Malhun Hatun...

925
01:29:11,370 --> 01:29:12,920
....is their children.

926
01:29:13,060 --> 01:29:15,190
They will fall out with each other...

927
01:29:17,540 --> 01:29:20,120
Orhan and Aladdin issue...

928
01:29:22,020 --> 01:29:25,580
...will help us set
Hatuns against each other.

929
01:29:26,640 --> 01:29:29,160
I will do as you say, my Sultan.

930
01:29:29,160 --> 01:29:30,900
This white horse...

931
01:29:31,180 --> 01:29:37,770
... will run to crush Osman Bey's
dreams of establishing a state.

932
01:29:42,140 --> 01:29:44,760
Ismihan Sultan does not interfere
in this for nothing.

933
01:29:46,360 --> 01:29:51,880
She thinks we want to dominate Oktem Bey
by taking Alcicek.

934
01:29:55,320 --> 01:29:57,500
For this reason, she wants to interfere.

935
01:30:01,900 --> 01:30:03,440
Be patient.

936
01:30:04,790 --> 01:30:06,510
I'll have that girl for you.

937
01:30:11,830 --> 01:30:15,540
I had promised your father that I would
arrange your wedding ceremony.

938
01:30:17,450 --> 01:30:20,970
- Insahllah my Bey.
- Inshallah.

939
01:30:25,380 --> 01:30:28,450
Bayindir has been following Ismihan
like a dog since she arrived.

940
01:30:29,100 --> 01:30:31,270
Obviously, those two set up this plan.

941
01:30:32,060 --> 01:30:37,130
Ismihan Sultan will take Oktem Bey away
from us by using Bayindir Bey.

942
01:30:39,980 --> 01:30:43,270
Saruca, still no news from him.

943
01:30:43,800 --> 01:30:46,830
- Sen alps.
- As you order, my Bey.

944
01:30:51,370 --> 01:30:54,820
The enemy is increasing and
the conquests are difficult

945
01:30:55,930 --> 01:30:58,500
Now things get really complicated, my Bey.

946
01:30:59,050 --> 01:31:02,140
Like you said, Malhun,
it's really difficult.

947
01:31:03,190 --> 01:31:06,840
From now on, difficulty has no importance.

948
01:31:07,220 --> 01:31:10,780
Here is the headquarters!
Here is the castle we will conquer!

949
01:31:11,450 --> 01:31:15,690
Neither the large number of the enemy....

950
01:31:16,605 --> 01:31:17,605
...nor us being few in number
won't make us step back!

951
01:31:18,520 --> 01:31:20,110
With the permission of our Allah...

952
01:31:21,000 --> 01:31:24,220
...Kopru Hisar will be ours by sunrise.

953
01:31:24,810 --> 01:31:27,580
Insha'Allah.

954
01:31:31,140 --> 01:31:33,180
Sogut.

955
01:31:34,680 --> 01:31:37,420
I want to host Sheik Edebali.

956
01:31:38,490 --> 01:31:40,540
He is the light of Oghuz.

957
01:31:40,590 --> 01:31:43,230
Osman's biggest weakness.

958
01:31:44,670 --> 01:31:46,720
If we turn off that light...

959
01:31:48,040 --> 01:31:50,540
...then we'll leave Osman in the dark.

960
01:32:03,360 --> 01:32:06,890
- Peace be upon you.
- Peace be upon you too my Sheik.

961
01:32:07,720 --> 01:32:09,580
You brought pleasure.

962
01:32:09,850 --> 01:32:12,730
You enlightened our home with your light.

963
01:32:12,840 --> 01:32:14,350
Not at all.

964
01:32:14,560 --> 01:32:15,860
Please.

965
01:32:19,150 --> 01:32:22,010
In the name of of Allah
the Merciful the Compassionate.

966
01:32:26,650 --> 01:32:29,450
Welcome, Ismihan Sultan.

967
01:32:30,680 --> 01:32:34,410
May your sudden arrival be a means of good.

968
01:32:35,100 --> 01:32:37,610
Wehave nothing to do with evil, my Sheik.

969
01:32:37,880 --> 01:32:40,410
Our intention is to do good deeds.

970
01:32:40,730 --> 01:32:45,340
And that the people benefit from this good.

971
01:32:45,680 --> 01:32:49,800
If your heart is the mirror
of your tongue...

972
01:32:49,990 --> 01:32:52,810
...there should be nothing to worry about,
Ismihan Sultan.

973
01:32:52,880 --> 01:32:55,640
Tell me, why did you come?

974
01:32:57,180 --> 01:33:02,270
I am starting to think that
our arrival in Sogut bothers you.

975
01:33:04,040 --> 01:33:05,850
This makes me sad, my sheik.

976
01:33:06,640 --> 01:33:10,190
Not at all.
Why would we be bothered?

977
01:33:10,570 --> 01:33:16,270
Sogut belongs to Allah,
like the rest of the world.

978
01:33:17,550 --> 01:33:21,820
Your presence is neither
grace nor distress for us.

979
01:33:22,410 --> 01:33:25,910
But your presence is a grace for us.

980
01:33:26,750 --> 01:33:28,880
I want to talk to you privately.

981
01:33:29,340 --> 01:33:33,660
About the current situation
of the Islamic world.

982
01:33:35,080 --> 01:33:36,860
Share my worries a little bit.

983
01:33:38,110 --> 01:33:39,930
You opened your table for me.

984
01:33:42,800 --> 01:33:47,640
And if you are sincere in your concerns,
then you will surely find a cure.

985
01:33:49,100 --> 01:33:50,960
Has it always been like this?

986
01:33:50,990 --> 01:33:54,720
Has the union of Muslims been so difficult
all the time?

987
01:33:55,020 --> 01:33:57,580
Staying away from arrogance?

988
01:33:58,760 --> 01:34:00,160
It has been always difficult.

989
01:34:01,130 --> 01:34:04,350
Tests for Muslims are always difficult.

990
01:34:04,890 --> 01:34:10,320
We experienecd difficulty because of the
hypocrites who concealed themselves.

991
01:34:10,420 --> 01:34:12,750
They are more dangerous than the enemy.

992
01:34:13,100 --> 01:34:17,660
The greatest harm to the Islamic world
was caused by the hypocrites.

993
01:34:18,430 --> 01:34:20,520
How do they do this, my sheikh?

994
01:34:20,780 --> 01:34:24,850
Those seem to be from us, however...

995
01:34:25,660 --> 01:34:28,180
They are our biggest enemies.

996
01:34:28,810 --> 01:34:30,540
They sit at our table

997
01:34:31,230 --> 01:34:34,010
And they invite us to their table, however...

998
01:34:34,350 --> 01:34:38,750
...The dagger in their hand plans
to stab us in the back.

999
01:34:39,130 --> 01:34:43,645
But we know that
all the hypocrites will definitely

1000
01:34:43,645 --> 01:34:48,345
get their share of the
Prophet's curse for them

1001
01:34:49,240 --> 01:34:53,800
I did not know that our beloved Prophet
had cursed anyone.

1002
01:34:54,900 --> 01:34:56,740
This means that he suffered a lot.

1003
01:34:57,650 --> 01:34:59,370
So he cursed them.

1004
01:35:00,580 --> 01:35:02,460
I want to know the reason for that.

1005
01:35:03,260 --> 01:35:04,960
At one point...

1006
01:35:05,790 --> 01:35:12,830
A messenger from Necid's deserts came
to our Prophet.

1007
01:35:12,850 --> 01:35:19,910
He asked for Hafizs to tell about Islam
to their community.

1008
01:35:20,280 --> 01:35:23,110
So the Messenger of God asked for safety.

1009
01:35:23,230 --> 01:35:24,760
He took a promise.

1010
01:35:24,830 --> 01:35:26,340
So that...

1011
01:35:26,930 --> 01:35:33,110
The lives of his companions can be safe.

1012
01:35:34,380 --> 01:35:36,250
And what happened next?

1013
01:35:36,860 --> 01:35:40,900
The hypocrites did what befits them.

1014
01:35:42,630 --> 01:35:44,720
When they arrived at the Ma'una's well...

1015
01:35:45,620 --> 01:35:48,810
...the fiercest army of infidels
was waiting for them.

1016
01:35:49,710 --> 01:35:53,340
Before they could say a word,
Hafizs were murdered.

1017
01:35:54,200 --> 01:35:56,250
Seventy Hafizs.

1018
01:35:57,140 --> 01:35:59,120
Seventy Quran lovers.

1019
01:36:00,010 --> 01:36:01,530
They fell martyr.

1020
01:36:02,340 --> 01:36:04,400
And when the news reached Medina...

1021
01:36:05,430 --> 01:36:07,690
...the hearts of the believers burned.

1022
01:36:08,540 --> 01:36:10,140
And they drowned in tears.

1023
01:36:10,770 --> 01:36:13,880
As for the hypocrites, they rejoiced.

1024
01:36:15,270 --> 01:36:17,530
The fire that burned the heart
of the Messenger of Allah...

1025
01:36:18,620 --> 01:36:20,500
...was such a scorching fire that...

1026
01:36:21,590 --> 01:36:25,060
Enes Bin Malik said he hadn't seen
the Messenger of Allah...

1027
01:36:25,210 --> 01:36:29,080
grieve over anything as much as
he grieves over his companions....

1028
01:36:29,635 --> 01:36:33,235
who were martyred at the well of Ma'una.

1029
01:36:34,360 --> 01:36:37,110
The Messenger of Allah, with the pain
in his heart,

1030
01:36:37,710 --> 01:36:40,260
...cursed the murderers of Hafizs...

1031
01:36:40,570 --> 01:36:43,560
...after every dawn prayer he performs.

1032
01:36:44,810 --> 01:36:46,360
He damned them.

1033
01:36:47,630 --> 01:36:49,170
I am surprised.

1034
01:36:50,380 --> 01:36:53,030
I thought he would have mercy on
them and pray for them

1035
01:36:53,100 --> 01:36:57,210
Mercy for the oppressor
is betrayal of the oppressed...

1036
01:36:57,730 --> 01:36:59,440
...Ismihan Sultan.

1037
01:36:59,790 --> 01:37:01,840
Such an unfortunate Hafizs.

1038
01:37:02,170 --> 01:37:03,900
Hafizs are martyr.

1039
01:37:04,610 --> 01:37:06,660
They received the prayer of the Prophet.

1040
01:37:07,760 --> 01:37:09,540
Why feel sorry for them?

1041
01:37:10,920 --> 01:37:12,760
All those educated people.

1042
01:37:13,700 --> 01:37:15,880
Moreover, they are companions to Prophet.

1043
01:37:16,380 --> 01:37:18,080
It is okay to be upset.

1044
01:37:18,490 --> 01:37:20,540
Do not be sad, Ismihan Sultan.

1045
01:37:22,960 --> 01:37:25,740
For us,
there is no higher rank than martyrdom.

1046
01:37:28,770 --> 01:37:30,340
However, fear that...

1047
01:37:32,090 --> 01:37:34,880
...fear for the possibility
to become a hypocrite.

1048
01:37:38,950 --> 01:37:41,030
In the name of of Allah
the Merciful the Compassionate

1049
01:37:44,110 --> 01:37:49,680
Fear that one may turn their back
on the truth and fall into contempt

1050
01:37:51,170 --> 01:37:53,740
The consequences of cruelty...

1051
01:37:56,060 --> 01:37:57,950
...are always miserable.

1052
01:38:09,070 --> 01:38:11,850
Marmarcik Castle.

1053
01:38:17,480 --> 01:38:19,350
They left me no other solution.

1054
01:38:27,050 --> 01:38:29,630
Who would want to crush
her mother and father's words?

1055
01:38:31,100 --> 01:38:32,330
No one would.

1056
01:39:09,650 --> 01:39:11,040
My Cicek.
(Cicek means flower)

1057
01:39:29,200 --> 01:39:30,710
My beautiful daughter.

1058
01:39:31,640 --> 01:39:33,360
Are you well?

1059
01:39:34,460 --> 01:39:36,350
Why would I not be okay, mother?

1060
01:39:37,250 --> 01:39:39,300
While you are in love with that boy...

1061
01:39:39,860 --> 01:39:42,360
...your father found it appropriate to
marry you to Bayindir.

1062
01:39:44,470 --> 01:39:46,190
I hope that doesn't make you sad.

1063
01:39:47,280 --> 01:39:52,930
My mother, my father and our Sultan
also found it appropriate.

1064
01:39:54,260 --> 01:39:55,980
Why would I be sad?

1065
01:40:00,310 --> 01:40:01,820
You make me happy.

1066
01:40:17,200 --> 01:40:19,270
What is wrong, my Cicek?

1067
01:40:20,390 --> 01:40:22,200
Where are you going?

1068
01:40:28,160 --> 01:40:31,350
I will not quit trading just because
I am going to marry, mother.

1069
01:40:33,640 --> 01:40:35,870
Business is waiting for me in the market.

1070
01:40:36,770 --> 01:40:38,490
Praise be to my daughter!

1071
01:40:40,840 --> 01:40:42,200
Off you go.

1072
01:40:42,340 --> 01:40:44,850
Go quickly and come back quickly.

1073
01:41:23,860 --> 01:41:25,160
Gokmen!

1074
01:41:30,000 --> 01:41:31,850
Tell Bayindir Bey.

1075
01:41:33,920 --> 01:41:36,260
His future wife will elope
with someone else.

1076
01:41:44,880 --> 01:41:47,660
Kantakouzanos is the sole heir to the throne.

1077
01:41:48,600 --> 01:41:50,340
We've blocked him twice.

1078
01:41:51,450 --> 01:41:55,210
But Andronicus is a fool.

1079
01:41:57,480 --> 01:42:00,070
Sooner or later,
Kantakouzanos will ascend the throne

1080
01:42:02,510 --> 01:42:04,090
And when he he does...

1081
01:42:06,920 --> 01:42:08,960
He will push the army towards Yenişehir.

1082
01:42:10,520 --> 01:42:12,090
The army...

1083
01:42:12,940 --> 01:42:17,030
...Bursa and Iznik,
they will stop here.

1084
01:42:20,800 --> 01:42:22,890
If we take over Kopru Hisar.

1085
01:42:23,290 --> 01:42:25,310
We'll create a line of defense here.

1086
01:42:26,940 --> 01:42:29,030
And if we can't conquer it...

1087
01:42:29,830 --> 01:42:32,850
Then we will not be able to
stop the army from attacking us.

1088
01:42:36,240 --> 01:42:39,090
Ismihan Hatun,
who think this is an opportunity for her...

1089
01:42:39,090 --> 01:42:40,740
...will damage us inside.

1090
01:42:42,060 --> 01:42:43,620
For this reason...

1091
01:42:43,710 --> 01:42:46,430
...this place is not just a conquest for us.

1092
01:42:47,500 --> 01:42:51,240
This is a matter of existance for us!

1093
01:42:53,680 --> 01:42:55,420
After the conquest of Marmaracik...

1094
01:42:55,720 --> 01:42:58,280
...the neighboring castles
increased their measures, my Bey.

1095
01:42:58,440 --> 01:42:59,960
All are in vain.

1096
01:43:00,210 --> 01:43:02,290
They will not be able to stand against us.

1097
01:43:02,290 --> 01:43:04,150
We will also increase our measures.

1098
01:43:04,470 --> 01:43:06,010
We'll, Cerkutay.

1099
01:43:07,280 --> 01:43:09,600
Konur, tell us about the news.

1100
01:43:10,070 --> 01:43:12,870
They are more than us in number, my Bey,
their walls are strong.

1101
01:43:13,560 --> 01:43:16,650
However, our discovery matches up
with Gürbüz Alp's information.

1102
01:43:19,240 --> 01:43:22,490
They have 5-toise (9 meters)
tall weak walls there.

1103
01:43:22,970 --> 01:43:25,500
They strengthened it, but it is not enough.

1104
01:43:28,220 --> 01:43:29,780
Konur.

1105
01:43:31,060 --> 01:43:33,150
You will approach them with five alps.

1106
01:43:35,430 --> 01:43:37,450
The walls will be lit with torches

1107
01:43:38,760 --> 01:43:40,290
Boran!

1108
01:43:41,370 --> 01:43:43,180
The catapults will shoot together.

1109
01:43:43,960 --> 01:43:46,040
And you'll blow a hole
in that wall on your first try.

1110
01:43:46,730 --> 01:43:49,880
A troop of alps will enter through that gap.

1111
01:43:50,290 --> 01:43:53,310
They will head for the gates
when they get inside.

1112
01:43:53,510 --> 01:43:55,050
When they open them...

1113
01:43:55,410 --> 01:43:58,480
...Alps and sister will start attacking.

1114
01:43:59,520 --> 01:44:01,550
Before the soldiers realise anything...

1115
01:44:02,720 --> 01:44:04,750
...we'll conquer Kopru Hisar Inshallah.

1116
01:44:04,860 --> 01:44:06,450
Insha'Allah

1117
01:44:07,980 --> 01:44:11,020
Bala, you'll be standing
behind those gates.

1118
01:44:13,150 --> 01:44:15,310
Konur, you'll lighten the walls.

1119
01:44:16,840 --> 01:44:19,990
Boran, and you will take care of
the catapults.

1120
01:44:22,770 --> 01:44:24,620
You'll manage the alps there.

1121
01:44:29,350 --> 01:44:34,250
And I'll be the first person
to get inside through that hole.

1122
01:44:36,870 --> 01:44:38,460
My Bey.

1123
01:44:39,280 --> 01:44:43,070
Our catapults and skillful
warriors are with Turgut Alp.

1124
01:44:46,360 --> 01:44:47,900
I don't want an excuse.

1125
01:44:49,150 --> 01:44:51,020
You will one shot there!

1126
01:44:51,300 --> 01:44:53,130
Otherwise, conquest fails.

1127
01:44:53,530 --> 01:44:55,330
Never forget that.

1128
01:44:56,720 --> 01:44:58,290
As you command my Bey.

1129
01:45:06,080 --> 01:45:07,880
When do we attack, Olof?

1130
01:45:09,320 --> 01:45:11,170
We'll wait for nightfall.

1131
01:45:12,310 --> 01:45:16,650
Darkness will fall upon them first,
and then us.

1132
01:45:17,230 --> 01:45:20,120
Is this going to end once
we destroy the headquarters, Olof?

1133
01:45:20,120 --> 01:45:21,170
Yes it will.

1134
01:45:22,320 --> 01:45:24,160
Because Turgut broke up with him.

1135
01:45:25,030 --> 01:45:26,920
Ismihan Sultan seperated them.

1136
01:45:28,520 --> 01:45:30,350
We will finish them.

1137
01:45:31,760 --> 01:45:33,880
Their important commander
is in the headquarters.

1138
01:45:34,570 --> 01:45:37,130
All siege weapons are in the headquarters.

1139
01:45:38,280 --> 01:45:40,100
When we destroy there...

1140
01:45:40,420 --> 01:45:42,260
...put conquering a castle aside...

1141
01:45:42,710 --> 01:45:44,820
...they won't even be able to
defend a town.

1142
01:45:45,740 --> 01:45:47,570
They are tattered inside and outside.

1143
01:45:48,690 --> 01:45:50,560
He is basically dead.

1144
01:45:50,950 --> 01:45:52,820
He just doesn't realize it.

1145
01:45:56,920 --> 01:45:58,470
Make preparations.

1146
01:45:58,930 --> 01:46:02,580
We'll stain Osman's camp with blood tonight.

1147
01:46:42,500 --> 01:46:45,380
We will answer the invitation
of Ismihan Hatun.

1148
01:46:45,890 --> 01:46:49,270
We are not willing to but we have to
play by their rules.

1149
01:46:50,670 --> 01:46:53,170
She will think we obey but...

1150
01:46:53,830 --> 01:46:55,210
...let her think that way.

1151
01:46:55,830 --> 01:46:57,350
Make preparations!

1152
01:46:58,680 --> 01:47:01,060
We'll start attacking
as soon as we get back.

1153
01:47:02,150 --> 01:47:03,510
Let's go.

1154
01:47:18,810 --> 01:47:20,330
Bala.

1155
01:47:22,370 --> 01:47:24,090
Why are you standing?

1156
01:47:24,280 --> 01:47:27,760
The camp must not be left empty, my Bey.
Our enemies are crowded.

1157
01:47:28,570 --> 01:47:31,390
I'd like to stay if you'll allow me.

1158
01:47:43,120 --> 01:47:46,640
Permission is yours, but take precautions.

1159
01:47:48,410 --> 01:47:52,000
When you are here,
I will not worry about here.

1160
01:47:56,920 --> 01:47:58,300
Go!

1161
01:47:59,270 --> 01:48:00,580
Go!

1162
01:48:36,070 --> 01:48:38,770
I am here Alcicek.
I am here.

1163
01:48:56,680 --> 01:49:00,880
Aktemur. Aktemur.

1164
01:49:01,630 --> 01:49:04,390
You did wrong to me Aktemur.

1165
01:49:05,410 --> 01:49:07,460
You will pay for it.

1166
01:49:11,180 --> 01:49:14,220
Alcicek is mine.

1167
01:49:39,430 --> 01:49:45,990
I cleaned up the trash between us,
Alcicek Hatun.

1168
01:49:49,290 --> 01:49:51,020
Where are you, Aktemur?

1169
01:49:52,370 --> 01:49:53,700
Where are you?

1170
01:49:56,270 --> 01:49:58,340
You're not going to
let hell swallow me, are you?

1171
01:49:59,720 --> 01:50:01,500
You won't do this to us.

1172
01:50:35,060 --> 01:50:36,580
You will come Aktemur.

1173
01:50:38,280 --> 01:50:39,620
You will come.

1174
01:50:59,950 --> 01:51:01,330
Mother.

1175
01:51:01,880 --> 01:51:03,390
Alcicek.

1176
01:51:04,150 --> 01:51:05,490
You...

1177
01:51:05,840 --> 01:51:08,370
Did this love blind your eyes, daughter?

1178
01:51:09,270 --> 01:51:11,140
How do you do this to us?

1179
01:51:12,560 --> 01:51:13,930
Mother.

1180
01:51:17,060 --> 01:51:18,570
He didn't come.

1181
01:51:19,790 --> 01:51:21,530
He didn't come, did he?

1182
01:51:21,890 --> 01:51:24,630
He won't come,
I knew it.

1183
01:51:25,750 --> 01:51:27,320
He will not come.

1184
01:51:39,340 --> 01:51:40,930
He didn't come, mother.

1185
01:51:43,680 --> 01:51:45,210
He didn't.

1186
01:51:49,890 --> 01:51:51,470
He left me alone.

1187
01:52:04,180 --> 01:52:05,570
Get up

1188
01:52:11,280 --> 01:52:12,620
Get up.

1189
01:52:16,890 --> 01:52:19,670
Is this fickle's vain love going to upset you?

1190
01:52:21,770 --> 01:52:23,290
You are my daughter.

1191
01:52:23,610 --> 01:52:25,640
Alcicek, you are strong.

1192
01:52:26,030 --> 01:52:27,900
You have to be strong.

1193
01:52:28,230 --> 01:52:29,800
Wipe away your tears.

1194
01:52:31,580 --> 01:52:37,340
It is a shame that you cry over a disloyal
man who left you alone.

1195
01:52:39,170 --> 01:52:40,690
Stand tall.

1196
01:52:46,130 --> 01:52:47,930
Well done my beautiful daughter.

1197
01:52:48,400 --> 01:52:49,980
Come on, let's go.

1198
01:52:56,030 --> 01:52:57,780
So you gave up on me!

1199
01:52:59,650 --> 01:53:01,240
Subasi.

1200
01:53:03,270 --> 01:53:05,320
So that's how much you love!

1201
01:53:32,410 --> 01:53:34,210
Sogut.

1202
01:53:35,080 --> 01:53:36,670
Peace be upon you.

1203
01:53:36,780 --> 01:53:38,330
Peace be upon you

1204
01:53:47,590 --> 01:53:50,910
Attention, Hadrat Mother Sultan!

1205
01:54:16,450 --> 01:54:17,990
Welcome.

1206
01:54:18,280 --> 01:54:20,330
Thank you Ismihan Sultan.

1207
01:54:21,510 --> 01:54:27,510
This khan and Sogut are your inheritance
from your father Ertugrtul.

1208
01:54:30,540 --> 01:54:33,730
It's your right to sit on the main corner.

1209
01:54:34,750 --> 01:54:36,090
Please.

1210
01:54:36,720 --> 01:54:38,570
In the presence of Mother Sultan...

1211
01:54:42,890 --> 01:54:46,720
...I will sit wherever she wants me to sit.

1212
01:54:52,220 --> 01:54:53,550
Eyvallah.

1213
01:55:11,890 --> 01:55:13,610
Where is Bala Hatun?

1214
01:55:15,240 --> 01:55:17,030
We have many enemies.

1215
01:55:17,280 --> 01:55:19,440
We did not leave Yenişehir without leader.

1216
01:55:23,080 --> 01:55:26,870
Tell us.
Why did you invite us?

1217
01:55:27,180 --> 01:55:29,570
We haven't been able to talk in detail
since we came.

1218
01:55:30,760 --> 01:55:34,460
It has always been a chaos.

1219
01:55:37,310 --> 01:55:39,160
First, I have to say that...

1220
01:55:39,730 --> 01:55:42,990
...Konya is grateful for your presence,
Osman Bey.

1221
01:55:44,010 --> 01:55:46,890
Thank you, thank you.

1222
01:55:48,160 --> 01:55:54,050
Well, are the other tribes grateful
for Konya being here?

1223
01:55:56,200 --> 01:55:59,130
Sultan Mesut came and freed Geyhatu.

1224
01:56:01,130 --> 01:56:04,470
You came and freed Kantakuzenos.

1225
01:56:06,240 --> 01:56:07,950
Konya frees our enemies...

1226
01:56:10,060 --> 01:56:12,130
....whenever we capture them.

1227
01:56:14,630 --> 01:56:17,870
We've been through all these things
together, Osman Bey.

1228
01:56:20,040 --> 01:56:26,550
Sultan Masut saved you from the teeth
of a Mongol army.

1229
01:56:27,550 --> 01:56:29,560
Well, what about you Ismihan Sultan?

1230
01:56:30,400 --> 01:56:32,550
From whom did you save us?

1231
01:56:34,150 --> 01:56:37,950
The news of his daughter's death and
the news of Kantakuzenos' captivity...

1232
01:56:38,300 --> 01:56:42,360
...were given to Emperor Andranikos
at the same time.

1233
01:56:45,590 --> 01:56:49,870
With all his anger, he wrote this letter
to Konya.

1234
01:57:00,470 --> 01:57:04,270
Kantakouzanos shall be freed.
Or else...

1235
01:57:06,920 --> 01:57:08,930
An Army will attack Yenisehir.

1236
01:57:15,890 --> 01:57:18,370
Kantakouzanos is the sole heir to the throne.

1237
01:57:22,160 --> 01:57:28,910
That is, Konya has saved you from
a great calamity again, Malhun Hatun.

1238
01:57:30,960 --> 01:57:32,550
Moreover...

1239
01:57:32,950 --> 01:57:36,450
Kantakouzanos is the one
who will sit on the throne from now on.

1240
01:57:37,290 --> 01:57:39,330
You are wrong, Ismihan Sultan.

1241
01:57:42,600 --> 01:57:44,160
The emperor is sick.

1242
01:57:45,670 --> 01:57:48,450
Kantakouzanos is sitting on the throne
temporarily.

1243
01:57:56,800 --> 01:57:59,170
Constantine
Emperor's Palace

1244
01:58:15,730 --> 01:58:20,960
Throne, you finally met your true friend.

1245
01:58:31,650 --> 01:58:33,820
Soon you will be completely mine.

1246
01:58:36,160 --> 01:58:38,410
When that sick Andronicus dies.

1247
01:58:40,270 --> 01:58:43,070
You shall be mine as I am the sole heir.

1248
01:58:46,230 --> 01:58:48,770
The rule of cowards will end.

1249
01:58:51,240 --> 01:58:54,280
By my light, Byzantium will be resurrected.

1250
01:58:55,040 --> 01:58:58,380
I will kill Osman and all the Turks.

1251
01:58:58,860 --> 01:59:00,440
Be ready.

1252
01:59:00,960 --> 01:59:02,490
Be ready.

1253
01:59:03,020 --> 01:59:05,520
Byzantium will bring you hell.

1254
01:59:10,680 --> 01:59:12,210
What's gone is gone.

1255
01:59:13,520 --> 01:59:16,100
I'm coming for what's left in your hands,
Osman.

1256
01:59:17,470 --> 01:59:19,340
For what's left in your hands.

1257
01:59:33,680 --> 01:59:35,500
Are you still crying?

1258
01:59:38,830 --> 01:59:40,880
Maybe he came after we left, mother.

1259
01:59:41,700 --> 01:59:43,480
I had to wait.

1260
01:59:43,690 --> 01:59:45,210
He said he would come.

1261
01:59:45,210 --> 01:59:47,860
But he didn't come, Alcicek!

1262
01:59:48,710 --> 01:59:51,560
He was afraid of Bayindir Bey and
Ismihan Sultan.

1263
01:59:52,400 --> 01:59:54,450
He gave up on you at the first difficulty.

1264
01:59:56,730 --> 01:59:58,480
You have to understand.

1265
01:59:58,520 --> 02:00:01,030
Your love and Aktemur's love are not equal.

1266
02:00:01,570 --> 02:00:03,100
Don't cry anymore.

1267
02:00:08,850 --> 02:00:10,370
I can't stop it.

1268
02:00:11,300 --> 02:00:12,890
My tears drop.

1269
02:00:27,330 --> 02:00:31,200
Sometimes you can't resist.

1270
02:00:33,810 --> 02:00:36,400
You know people go no matter
what you do to stop them.

1271
02:00:37,370 --> 02:00:38,870
Like I did.

1272
02:00:41,710 --> 02:00:44,370
I didn't stop you even though
I knew you'd try to elope.

1273
02:00:46,880 --> 02:00:48,200
Why?

1274
02:00:48,950 --> 02:00:50,480
You are my daughter.

1275
02:00:51,320 --> 02:00:53,870
You wouldn't stop before
doing what you want to do.

1276
02:01:00,020 --> 02:01:01,540
I wish you had stopped me, mother.

1277
02:01:02,740 --> 02:01:04,290
I wish you had stopped me.

1278
02:01:05,280 --> 02:01:07,100
So that I wouldn't go through this.

1279
02:01:07,870 --> 02:01:09,760
Let your heart burn.

1280
02:01:10,930 --> 02:01:13,950
This pain will not let you forget
the lesson you learned.

1281
02:01:15,950 --> 02:01:18,020
You had a dream, my daughter.

1282
02:01:18,940 --> 02:01:21,030
You just woke up from this dream.

1283
02:01:22,840 --> 02:01:26,080
Aktemur is a temporary obsession.

1284
02:01:28,140 --> 02:01:31,980
If you had married him, you would be only
a wife of Subasi. Nothing more.

1285
02:01:33,920 --> 02:01:35,920
But Bayindir Bey is different.

1286
02:01:36,870 --> 02:01:40,160
Ismihan Sultan supports him.

1287
02:01:41,620 --> 02:01:44,910
You think about the present,
I think about the future.

1288
02:01:46,960 --> 02:01:48,010
My beautiful daughter.

1289
02:01:49,650 --> 02:01:55,140
You will not shed tears for someone who
abandoned you and left you behind.

1290
02:01:56,180 --> 02:01:58,540
You will destroy if anyone crushes you!

1291
02:01:58,560 --> 02:01:59,830
Mother...

1292
02:01:59,830 --> 02:02:01,850
You're a sensible girl, Alcicek.

1293
02:02:03,930 --> 02:02:06,690
Act with your head, not your heart.

1294
02:02:14,880 --> 02:02:16,720
From now on, I will listen to you.

1295
02:02:19,470 --> 02:02:21,180
I will marry Bayindir Bey.

1296
02:02:34,810 --> 02:02:36,150
Let's go!

1297
02:02:37,180 --> 02:02:39,230
Bala Hatun is coming!

1298
02:03:07,470 --> 02:03:09,010
Alps!

1299
02:03:10,790 --> 02:03:12,340
Sisters!

1300
02:03:12,940 --> 02:03:15,450
We deployed our valiants
in front of Kopru Hisar.

1301
02:03:15,850 --> 02:03:21,070
Once we attack at dawn,
they'll start the attack there as well.

1302
02:03:22,910 --> 02:03:25,690
Valiants of Kayi!
Valiant Hatuns!

1303
02:03:26,300 --> 02:03:30,780
Let the blue sky split open and the
black earth split open!

1304
02:03:30,960 --> 02:03:35,510
Let the swords of justice
we carry come out of their sheaths!

1305
02:03:36,020 --> 02:03:37,530
May our conquest be blessed!

1306
02:03:37,560 --> 02:03:39,090
- Amen!
- Amen!

1307
02:03:40,720 --> 02:03:43,470
Konur Alp!
Get the catapults ready.

1308
02:03:44,020 --> 02:03:46,860
You will arrive at the walls before dawn.

1309
02:03:46,860 --> 02:03:48,160
Your command, Bala Hatun.

1310
02:03:48,460 --> 02:03:49,980
Come on, my brothers!

1311
02:03:55,600 --> 02:03:57,380
It's time.

1312
02:03:58,380 --> 02:04:01,380
Only the smell of death will
spread tonight.

1313
02:04:13,200 --> 02:04:14,780
Alps!

1314
02:04:14,840 --> 02:04:16,390
Raid!
Get in the position!

1315
02:04:16,470 --> 02:04:17,780
Now!

1316
02:04:53,300 --> 02:04:54,600
Catapults.

1317
02:05:00,320 --> 02:05:01,860
You dog!

1318
02:05:07,050 --> 02:05:10,220
Who will save you from my hands now?

1319
02:05:10,540 --> 02:05:11,890
Who?

1320
02:05:15,820 --> 02:05:17,830
Everything will be flattened!

1321
02:05:18,110 --> 02:05:20,340
Everything!
Attack!

1322
02:05:27,800 --> 02:05:30,120
You want to finish yourself huh?

1323
02:05:30,500 --> 02:05:31,860
Come on then.

1324
02:05:36,290 --> 02:05:37,610
Come on!

1325
02:07:04,090 --> 02:07:07,630
Game of thrones and rulers.

1326
02:07:08,250 --> 02:07:13,450
I hope Kantakouzanos doesn't make
a mistake to us, for the sake of our alliance.

1327
02:07:14,910 --> 02:07:17,100
Peace will come, Osman Bey.

1328
02:07:17,900 --> 02:07:20,450
Of course, only if you don't make
a counter strike.

1329
02:07:20,450 --> 02:07:22,530
We are not the ones who want peace.

1330
02:07:24,520 --> 02:07:27,090
We're just giving a break.

1331
02:07:29,640 --> 02:07:31,010
However...

1332
02:07:32,460 --> 02:07:34,640
If Mother Sultan wants peace...

1333
02:07:36,730 --> 02:07:39,540
...it is a must to obey her.

1334
02:07:43,670 --> 02:07:44,870
I am grateful to you.

1335
02:07:49,320 --> 02:07:52,470
I hope you're not upset about
Alcicek issue.

1336
02:07:52,670 --> 02:07:55,100
Good deeds require fast happening.

1337
02:07:55,770 --> 02:07:58,320
We didn't know you wanted her.

1338
02:07:58,650 --> 02:08:01,160
There is no certainty about anything.

1339
02:08:01,950 --> 02:08:03,760
Everything is about destiny.

1340
02:08:04,540 --> 02:08:06,260
We wish the best.

1341
02:08:06,410 --> 02:08:08,150
This is the best.

1342
02:08:11,010 --> 02:08:14,010
By the way, my son Sultan Aladdin...

1343
02:08:14,180 --> 02:08:18,030
...send a lot of gifts to Aladdin because
he has the same.

1344
02:08:20,160 --> 02:08:25,540
He gifted the most beautiful horse to
the son who is going to be a Bey.

1345
02:08:31,160 --> 02:08:35,680
And the sharpest sword for Orhan.

1346
02:08:36,970 --> 02:08:41,220
To use it to protect his Bey.

1347
02:08:53,150 --> 02:08:54,960
Thank you Mother Sultan.

1348
02:08:57,440 --> 02:08:58,950
Sons.

1349
02:08:59,750 --> 02:09:02,850
Check the gifts given by Mother Sultan.

1350
02:09:20,260 --> 02:09:27,520
I see that you decided which son to
be the heir of the throne, Ismihan Sultan.

1351
02:09:28,610 --> 02:09:31,110
Not at all, Malhun Hatun.

1352
02:09:31,640 --> 02:09:33,470
I say that for you.

1353
02:09:34,070 --> 02:09:37,500
This is a custom in Kayi tribe.

1354
02:09:38,430 --> 02:09:40,500
The little ones sit on the throne.

1355
02:09:41,420 --> 02:09:43,300
And the big brothers protect them.

1356
02:09:44,040 --> 02:09:45,610
That's what we heard.

1357
02:09:59,130 --> 02:10:02,240
Our men have chased
this horse for years.

1358
02:10:02,960 --> 02:10:05,490
It took a long time to catch him.

1359
02:10:06,500 --> 02:10:09,630
When Sultan Aladdin heard your name...

1360
02:10:10,440 --> 02:10:13,010
...he wanted to gift him to you, Aladdin Bey.

1361
02:10:17,760 --> 02:10:19,630
Really, it's very beautiful.

1362
02:10:19,820 --> 02:10:23,850
I will write a letter of gratitude
to Sultan, Avci Bey.

1363
02:10:26,020 --> 02:10:27,820
It's very beautiful, brother.

1364
02:10:29,550 --> 02:10:31,090
What are you going to call him?

1365
02:10:32,910 --> 02:10:37,350
His name is...
Akyel.

1366
02:10:38,050 --> 02:10:39,960
Praise be! Praise be!

1367
02:10:47,100 --> 02:10:48,220
So brother...

1368
02:10:48,790 --> 02:10:51,160
What are you going to name your sword?

1369
02:11:12,310 --> 02:11:14,510
I'll call it a game breaker, brother.

1370
02:11:15,920 --> 02:11:18,270
Don't worry Aladdin Bey.

1371
02:11:18,660 --> 02:11:20,630
I'll arrange a saddle.

1372
02:11:33,120 --> 02:11:36,660
You must be wondering why
we haven't started eating yet.

1373
02:11:38,020 --> 02:11:40,160
Because we have another guest.

1374
02:12:40,390 --> 02:12:41,950
Peace be upon you.

1375
02:12:42,010 --> 02:12:44,050
And may peace be upon you.

1376
02:12:44,190 --> 02:12:46,230
And may peace be upon you

1377
02:13:58,200 --> 02:13:59,960
You will die, snake!

1378
02:14:00,030 --> 02:14:01,880
I swear you will die!

1379
02:14:02,340 --> 02:14:04,180
Don't waste your breath in vain.

1380
02:14:04,260 --> 02:14:06,270
We breathe for martyrdom.

1381
02:14:22,930 --> 02:14:24,710
My Allah, give me strength!

1382
02:14:38,440 --> 02:14:40,520
It's your end now, snake!

1383
02:14:40,520 --> 02:14:42,040
Olof!

1384
02:15:05,460 --> 02:15:06,820
I will kill you.

1385
02:15:07,390 --> 02:15:09,910
I will put Osman in a great pain.

1386
02:15:11,720 --> 02:15:13,600
You will not run away from your end.

1387
02:15:23,050 --> 02:15:25,190
Say what you're going to say quickly.

1388
02:15:27,090 --> 02:15:28,430
Correct.

1389
02:15:28,970 --> 02:15:30,840
No need to prolong it.

1390
02:15:33,220 --> 02:15:39,280
You should know that we are at the same page
with Ismihan Sultan now.

1391
02:15:39,590 --> 02:15:41,310
There is no doubt about this.

1392
02:15:43,780 --> 02:15:45,860
Who does not seek power?

1393
02:15:49,420 --> 02:15:51,470
Who doesn't want a throne?

1394
02:16:01,080 --> 02:16:02,790
Your absence in our way..

1395
02:16:03,960 --> 02:16:05,520
...lessens only you...

1396
02:16:06,920 --> 02:16:09,160
...not our way.

1397
02:16:09,890 --> 02:16:12,000
I did not stray from the way.

1398
02:16:12,160 --> 02:16:14,180
Why would you say that?

1399
02:16:15,630 --> 02:16:18,200
Even if the path is different,
the goal is the same!

1400
02:16:19,560 --> 02:16:23,080
Do not consider us your enemies
because we do not follow you

1401
02:16:23,130 --> 02:16:24,650
No Osman Bey.

1402
02:16:24,940 --> 02:16:27,010
If anything happens to my people...

1403
02:16:28,030 --> 02:16:31,440
...because you left...

1404
02:16:35,690 --> 02:16:37,730
You will pay for it with your head.

1405
02:16:41,100 --> 02:16:45,180
No one will be beheaded, Osman Bey.

1406
02:16:48,058 --> 02:16:54,558
Peace and order will be secured
under the rule of the Seljuk state.

1407
02:16:56,299 --> 02:17:04,340
In the existence of the state, no one shall
do the state business!

1408
02:17:14,138 --> 02:17:16,170
Ismihan Sultan.

1409
02:17:16,930 --> 02:17:22,840
Olof attacked a Turkish headquarters
near Kopru Hisar.

1410
02:17:34,850 --> 02:17:36,388
The situation is dangerous.

1411
02:17:45,379 --> 02:17:47,959
Who is this Osman Bey?

1412
02:17:50,330 --> 02:17:55,340
Who established headquarters
in front of Kopru Hisar?

1413
02:18:02,629 --> 02:18:04,440
The headquarters is mine.

1414
02:18:05,030 --> 02:18:06,830
The command is mine.

1415
02:18:07,620 --> 02:18:10,968
And I decide whose head will be cut off.

1416
02:18:21,129 --> 02:18:31,308
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries